{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B3fyJuid9J41ZGUj9XTC1E","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 4 从 \"SDF is redundant\" 降级为 \"SDF is largely redundant at\n2\t  typical lambda\n3\t\n4\t  (≤0.01); extreme lambda (0.1) shows marginal, statistically ambiguous CAR benefit\n5\t\n6\t  (~+6pp) that does not justify added complexity.\" Phase 2 弱持久性信号需承认但 frame\n7\t\n8\t  为 \"weak and practically insignificant — TSR remains collapsed at 16.5%.\"\n9\t\n10\t  LoRA seed2 拉低 3-seed 均值至 52.8%，3v3 one-sided p=0.24，无法 claim \"statistically\n11\t\n12\t  indistinguishable\" 但差异无实际意义。论文叙事从 \"clean negative\" 变为 \"predominantly\n13\t\n14\t  negative with boundary conditions.\" Claims 1-3 不受影响。dfCAR threshold 在\n15\t\n16\t  δ∈[2mm,200mm] 完全稳定。spatial_bowl 缺少 LoRA control 无法做跨场景 SDF 归因。\n17\t\n18\t  CoRL 估算 45-55%。需补充一段 discussion 解释 lambda dose-response 的 ceiling\n19\t\n20\t  和 practical implications。Claim 4 措辞加 hedging: \"largely redundant\" /\n21\t\n22\t  \"provides no practically significant benefit at standard hyperparameter ranges.\"\n23\t\n24\t  '\n25\timagined_experiments:\n26\t- name: LoRA baseline eval (2 seeds)\n27\t  plan_id: plan_003\n28\t  description: LoRA-only (无 SDF) 30K checkpoint eval, 2 seeds × 200 episodes\n29\t  expected_results:\n30\t    seed0_avg_CAR: 54.5\n31\t    seed0_avg_TSR: 8.5\n32\t    seed0_avg_ee_disp: 0.489\n33\t    seed0_frozen_pct: 0\n34\t    seed1_avg_CAR: 56.0\n35\t    seed1_avg_TSR: 4.0\n36\t    seed1_avg_ee_disp: 0.467\n37\t    seed1_frozen_pct: 0\n38\t    two_seed_mean_CAR: 55.25\n39\t    two_seed_mean_TSR: 6.25\n40\t    dfCAR_100mm: 55.25\n41\t    fake_safety: false\n42\t  result_rationale: '已确认数据。LoRA fine-tuning on collision-free demonstrations 产生真实碰撞避免:\n43\t\n44\t    EE displacement ~0.48m 证实机器人正常运动 (非 action collapse), frozen_pct=0%,\n45\t\n46\t    dfCAR = raw CAR (无 filtering)。CAR=55% 代表 +29pp vs Pi0.5 baseline (27%),\n47\t\n48\t    完全来自隐式 demo 信号而非几何监督。TSR 从 73% 坍缩至 6.25% 是 catastrophic\n49\t\n50\t    forgetting 的结果——模型学会了保守行为 (conservative avoidance) 而非真正的安全\n51\t\n52\t    感知 (safety awareness)。两个 seed 间 CAR 差异 1.5pp 在评估噪声范围内。\n53\t\n54\t    '\n55\t  tables:\n56\t  - name: LoRA-only Per-Task Breakdown (2 seeds)\n57\t    columns:\n58\t    - Task\n59\t    - s0 CAR\n60\t    - s0 TSR\n61\t    - s0 EE Disp\n62\t    - s1 CAR\n63\t    - s1 TSR\n64\t    - s1 EE Disp\n65\t    rows:\n66\t    - - orange_juice\n67\t      - '62'\n68\t      - '0'\n69\t      - '0.497'\n70\t      - '58'\n71\t      - '2'\n72\t      - '0.483'\n73\t    - - chocolate_pudding\n74\t      - '44'\n75\t      - '34'\n76\t      - '0.504'\n77\t      - '50'\n78\t      - '14'\n79\t      - '0.538'\n80\t    - - milk\n81\t      - '94'\n82\t      - '0'\n83\t      - '0.577'\n84\t      - '90'\n85\t      - '0'\n86\t      - '0.482'\n87\t    - - bbq_sauce\n88\t      - '18'\n89\t      - '0'\n90\t      - '0.377'\n91\t      - '26'\n92\t      - '0'\n93\t      - '0.365'\n94\t    - - Mean\n95\t      - '54.5'\n96\t      - '8.5'\n97\t      - '0.489'\n98\t      - '56.0'\n99\t      - '4.0'\n100\t      - '0.467'\n101\t  figures_description:\n102\t  - 'Bar chart: 4-task CAR for LoRA s0 vs s1, 展示 per-task pattern 一致性 (milk 最高, bbq_sauce\n103\t    最低)'\n104\t  analysis: 'LoRA-only 已建立真实避障 baseline: CAR=55%, 0% fake safety, EE disp ~0.48m。\n105\t\n106\t    Per-task pattern 由任务布局决定 (milk 障碍物位置有利, bbq_sauce 障碍物遮挡严重),\n107\t\n108\t    这一 pattern 在 SDF 模型中完全复制——进一步说明 CAR 来源是 demo imitation 而非\n109\t\n110\t    geometric supervision。2-seed 数据足以建立 baseline, 但 3v3 统计对比需 seed2。\n111\t\n112\t    '\n113\t- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 training (seed2)\n114\t  plan_id: plan_005\n115\t  description: 从 train_pi05_a1_obj_s2_l005 的 10K SDF checkpoint resume, λ=0 训练至 30K\n116\t  expected_results:\n117\t    final_loss: 0.0118\n118\t    best_loss: 0.0089\n119\t    best_step: 22000\n120\t    total_steps: 30000\n121\t    grad_norm: 0.112\n122\t    time_per_step: 4.6\n123\t    training_stable: true\n124\t  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 从已有 SDF imprint 的 10K checkpoint 出发, 移除 SDF loss (λ=0)\n125\t    继续训练\n126\t\n127\t    20K 步。loss 从 ~0.015 (10K SDF 的 total_loss) 下降到 ~0.012, 因为移除 SDF\n128\t\n129\t    auxiliary loss 后模型只需优化 action loss, 训练变得更容易。但 loss 不会降到\n130\t\n131\t    LoRA-only 水平 (0.010) 因为 10K 步 SDF 训练已改变了模型的 representation\n132\t\n133\t    landscape, 后续优化在不同的 basin 中进行。best_loss 出现在 22K 步 (即 Phase 2\n134\t\n135\t    的 12K 步处), 之后因缺乏 demo 多样性而轻微过拟合。训练稳定, 无 NaN 或梯度爆炸。\n136\t\n137\t    '\n138\t  tables: []\n139\t  figures_description: []\n140\t  analysis: '训练成功完成。loss 轨迹确认 SDF removal 后模型能正常优化, 但 loss 轨迹\n141\t\n142\t    与 LoRA-only 不同, 暗示 SDF 训练确实改变了 model 的 loss landscape。\n143\t\n144\t    '\n145\t- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 eval (seed2)\n146\t  plan_id: plan_006\n147\t  description: Phase 2 训练完成后 eval, 200 episodes, 提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement\n148\t  expected_results:\n149\t    avg_CAR: 61\n150\t    avg_TSR: 18\n151\t    n_episodes: 200\n152\t    avg_ee_disp: 0.462\n153\t    frozen_pct: 0\n154\t    dfCAR_100mm: 61\n155\t    task0_CAR: 68\n156\t    task0_TSR: 10\n157\t    task0_ee_disp: 0.478\n158\t    task1_CAR: 48\n159\t    task1_TSR: 48\n160\t    task1_ee_disp: 0.502\n161\t    task2_CAR: 86\n162\t    task2_TSR: 2\n163\t    task2_ee_disp: 0.542\n164\t    task3_CAR: 42\n165\t    task3_TSR: 12\n166\t    task3_ee_disp: 0.326\n167\t  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 CAR=61% 高于 LoRA-only (55%) 和 SDF 30K (50.5%), 暗示 SDF\n168\t    留下了弱\n169\t\n170\t    持久效应。机制解释: 10K 步 SDF 训练在模型 intermediate representations 中\n171\t\n172\t    编码了微弱的几何距离感知, 当 SDF loss 移除后, 这些 representations 部分保留\n173\t\n174\t    (不被后续训练完全覆盖), 产生略高的碰撞避免率。\n175\t\n176\t\n177\t    但这个 +6pp 效应在统计上模糊: 单 seed 评估的 eval noise 约 ±3-5pp (参见\n178\t\n179\t    s0 λ=0.005 两次评估差 3pp)。需要 plan_012 的第二个 Phase 2 seed 确认。\n180\t\n181\t\n182\t    TSR=18% 部分恢复 (vs SDF 30K 的 ~7% 和 baseline 的 73%): 移除 SDF loss\n183\t\n184\t    允许模型在后续 20K 步中部分重新学习 task completion, 但起始点 (10K SDF\n185\t\n186\t    checkpoint) 已经严重偏离 task-optimal trajectory, 恢复有限。task1 (chocolate_pudding)\n187\t\n188\t    恢复最好 (TSR=48%) 因为该任务最 \"可学\" (baseline TSR=86%); task2 (milk)\n189\t\n190\t    几乎不恢复 (TSR=2%) 因为其 CAR 已经很高 (86%), 模型选择保持保守。\n191\t\n192\t\n193\t    关键: 即使 Phase 2 CAR 偏高, TSR=18% 仍远低于实用要求, 说明 two-phase strategy\n194\t\n195\t    (先学 safety → 再恢复 task) 在当前训练量和 LoRA 配置下不可行。\n196\t\n197\t    '\n198\t  tables:\n199\t  - name: Phase 2 vs LoRA-only vs SDF 30K 对比\n200\t    columns:\n201\t    - Condition\n202\t    - CAR (%)\n203\t    - TSR (%)\n204\t    - EE Disp (m)\n205\t    - Fake Safe\n206\t    - Seeds\n207\t    rows:\n208\t    - - Pi0.5 baseline\n209\t      - '27.0'\n210\t      - '74.7'\n211\t      - '0.15'\n212\t      - 98.2%\n213\t      - '3'\n214\t    - - LoRA-only 30K\n215\t      - '52.8'\n216\t      - '5.8'\n217\t      - '0.48'\n218\t      - 0%\n219\t      - 3*\n220\t    - - SDF lambda=0.005 30K\n221\t      - '50.5'\n222\t      - '6.8'\n223\t      - '0.48'\n224\t      - 0%\n225\t      - '3'\n226\t    - - SDF lambda=0.01 30K\n227\t      - '52.7'\n228\t      - '7.0'\n229\t      - '0.48'\n230\t      - 0%\n231\t      - '3'\n232\t    - - Phase 2 (10K SDF -> 20K lambda=0)\n233\t      - '61.0'\n234\t      - '18.0'\n235\t      - '0.46'\n236\t      - 0%\n237\t      - '1'\n238\t  - name: Phase 2 Per-Task Breakdown (seed2)\n239\t    columns:\n240\t    - Task\n241\t    - CAR (%)\n242\t    - TSR (%)\n243\t    - EE Disp (m)\n244\t    rows:\n245\t    - - orange_juice\n246\t      - '68'\n247\t      - '10'\n248\t      - '0.478'\n249\t    - - chocolate_pudding\n250\t      - '48'\n251\t      - '48'\n252\t      - '0.502'\n253\t    - - milk\n254\t      - '86'\n255\t      - '2'\n256\t      - '0.542'\n257\t    - - bbq_sauce\n258\t      - '42'\n259\t      - '12'\n260\t      - '0.326'\n261\t    - - Mean\n262\t      - '61'\n263\t      - '18'\n264\t      - '0.462'\n265\t  figures_description:\n266\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: CAR/TSR for LoRA-only vs SDF 30K vs Phase 2, 显示 Phase 2 的\n267\t    CAR 略高但 TSR 仍坍缩'\n268\t  - 'Per-task scatter: Phase 2 per-task CAR vs LoRA-only per-task CAR, 预期 Phase 2\n269\t    全面略高但保持同样的 task ordering'\n270\t  analysis: 'Phase 2 呈现弱 persistence 信号: CAR 比 LoRA-only 高 ~6pp, TSR 部分恢复至 18%。\n271\t\n272\t    但单 seed 不足以做统计推断。这个结果需要 hedging: \"Phase 2 shows a trend toward\n273\t\n274\t    weak SDF persistence, but with n=1 and evaluation noise of ±5pp, the effect is\n275\t\n276\t    not statistically reliable.\" TSR=18% 远低于 baseline 73%, 说明 two-phase strategy\n277\t\n278\t    在当前配置下不具实用性。论文中应放在 discussion 而非 main results。\n279\t\n280\t    '\n281\t- name: spatial_bowl A1 SDF training\n282\t  plan_id: plan_007\n283\t  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF (λ=0.005) on spatial_bowl scene, seed0, 30K steps\n284\t  expected_results:\n285\t    final_loss: 0.0152\n286\t    best_loss: 0.0128\n287\t    best_step: 20000\n288\t    total_steps: 30000\n289\t    grad_norm: 0.18\n290\t    time_per_step: 4.8\n291\t    training_stable: true\n292\t  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl 场景的 loss 高于 object_pudding (0.013 vs 0.008) 因为:\n293\t    (1) spatial\n294\t\n295\t    tasks 涉及更复杂的操作路径 (在 plate/ramekin 间取碗), action 预测难度更高;\n296\t\n297\t    (2) SDF loss 在 spatial 场景中贡献更大 (更多 close-proximity 情况), 推高\n298\t\n299\t    total loss。训练稳定, 无异常。best_loss 出现在 20K 步而非 26K, 因为 spatial\n300\t\n301\t    场景的 SDF loss 使训练曲线更不稳定, 过拟合更早出现。\n302\t\n303\t    '\n304\t  tables: []\n305\t  figures_description: []\n306\t  analysis: '训练成功完成。spatial_bowl 训练的 loss 比 object_pudding 高约 60%, 反映场景\n307\t\n308\t    复杂度差异。跨场景 SDF 效果归因需要 plan_015 (LoRA-only control) 完成,\n309\t\n310\t    但在 median tier 下 plan_015 不会在 deadline 前完成。\n311\t\n312\t    '\n313\t- name: spatial_bowl SDF eval\n314\t  plan_id: plan_008\n315\t  description: spatial_bowl A1 训练完成后 eval, 200 episodes, 验证跨场景 CAR/TSR pattern\n316\t  expected_results:\n317\t    avg_CAR: 35\n318\t    avg_TSR: 3\n319\t    n_episodes: 200\n320\t    avg_ee_disp: 0.248\n321\t    frozen_pct: 0\n322\t    fake_safety: false\n323\t    task0_CAR: 38\n324\t    task0_TSR: 4\n325\t    task0_ee_disp: 0.263\n326\t    task1_CAR: 28\n327\t    task1_TSR: 0\n328\t    task1_ee_disp: 0.231\n329\t    task2_CAR: 48\n330\t    task2_TSR: 6\n331\t    task2_ee_disp: 0.274\n332\t    task3_CAR: 26\n333\t    task3_TSR: 2\n334\t    task3_ee_disp: 0.224\n335\t  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl SDF CAR=35% 显著低于 object_pudding SDF (50.5%), 原因:\n336\t\n337\t    (1) spatial_bowl 任务布局更紧凑——碗被 plate/ramekin/stove 环绕, 机械臂\n338\t\n339\t    几乎不可能在不碰触障碍物的情况下完成 pick 动作; (2) 碰撞类型以 arm-body\n340\t\n341\t    为主 (EE-only SDF 无法防护); (3) 障碍物体积更大且更密集。\n342\t\n343\t\n344\t    EE displacement ~0.25m 低于 object_pudding (0.48m) 因为 spatial tasks 的\n345\t\n346\t    操作空间更小, 机械臂运动范围受限。fake_safety=0% 确认 SDF LoRA 在\n347\t\n348\t    spatial_bowl 也产生真实运动。\n349\t\n350\t\n351\t    task2 (pick_bowl_on_stove) CAR 最高 (48%) 因为 stove 上方空间较大,\n352\t\n353\t    碰撞风险较低; task3 (pick_bowl_on_cabinet) CAR 最低 (26%) 因为 cabinet\n354\t\n355\t    两侧有遮挡。TSR=3% 极低, 与 object_pudding 的 TSR=7% 一致——都是\n356\t\n357\t    catastrophic forgetting, spatial 更严重因为任务本身更难 (baseline TSR=57.5%)。\n358\t\n359\t\n360\t    关键限制: 没有 spatial_bowl LoRA-only control (plan_015), 无法判断这\n361\t\n362\t    35% CAR 是 SDF 贡献还是 LoRA-only 就能达到。如果 spatial LoRA-only\n363\t\n364\t    CAR 也 ~35%, 则进一步确认 SDF 冗余; 如果 CAR ~26% (接近 baseline),\n365\t\n366\t    则 SDF 可能在 spatial 场景有 +9pp 效应——但无法验证。\n367\t\n368\t    '\n369\t  tables:\n370\t  - name: spatial_bowl Per-Task Breakdown\n371\t    columns:\n372\t    - Task\n373\t    - CAR (%)\n374\t    - TSR (%)\n375\t    - EE Disp (m)\n376\t    rows:\n377\t    - - bowl_between_plate_ramekin\n378\t      - '38'\n379\t      - '4'\n380\t      - '0.263'\n381\t    - - bowl_on_ramekin\n382\t      - '28'\n383\t      - '0'\n384\t      - '0.231'\n385\t    - - bowl_on_stove\n386\t      - '48'\n387\t      - '6'\n388\t      - '0.274'\n389\t    - - bowl_on_cabinet\n390\t      - '26'\n391\t      - '2'\n392\t      - '0.224'\n393\t    - - Mean\n394\t      - '35'\n395\t      - '3'\n396\t      - '0.248'\n397\t  - name: 跨场景对比 (SDF lambda=0.005)\n398\t    columns:\n399\t    - Scene\n400\t    - CAR (%)\n401\t    - TSR (%)\n402\t    - EE Disp (m)\n403\t    - LoRA Control?\n404\t    rows:\n405\t    - - object_pudding\n406\t      - '50.5'\n407\t      - '6.8'\n408\t      - '0.48'\n409\t      - Yes (3 seeds)\n410\t    - - spatial_bowl\n411\t      - '35'\n412\t      - '3'\n413\t      - '0.25'\n414\t      - 'No'\n415\t  figures_description:\n416\t  - 'Side-by-side per-task CAR bar chart: object_pudding vs spatial_bowl, 展示 CAR 在\n417\t    spatial 场景系统性下降'\n418\t  analysis: 'spatial_bowl 数据展示 SDF+LoRA 的跨场景泛化, 但因缺少 LoRA-only control\n419\t\n420\t    (plan_015), 无法做 SDF 归因。在论文中只能呈现为 \"SDF+LoRA in spatial_bowl\n421\t\n422\t    achieves 35% CAR with 0% fake safety\" 而不能说 \"SDF contributes Xpp.\"\n423\t\n424\t    这是 median tier 的关键 gap: 跨场景 SDF attribution 缺失。\n425\t\n426\t    建议: 论文放在 appendix 作为跨场景泛化的 preliminary observation, 而非\n427\t\n428\t    main claim 的 evidence。\n429\t\n430\t    '\n431\t- name: Lambda=0.1 bracket training (2 seeds)\n432\t  plan_id: plan_009\n433\t  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF (λ=0.1) on object_pudding, s0+s1, 30K steps each\n434\t  expected_results:\n435\t    seed0_final_loss: 0.0385\n436\t    seed0_best_loss: 0.0312\n437\t    seed0_best_step: 16000\n438\t    seed1_final_loss: 0.0371\n439\t    seed1_best_loss: 0.0298\n440\t    seed1_best_step: 18000\n441\t    total_steps: 30000\n442\t    training_stable: true\n443\t  result_rationale: 'λ=0.1 的 total loss 显著高于 λ=0.005/0.01 (0.038 vs 0.014) 因为 SDF\n444\t\n445\t    auxiliary loss 在高 lambda 下成为 dominant loss component。action_loss 本身\n446\t\n447\t    可能只有 ~0.012, 但 SDF loss × 0.1 贡献 ~0.025, 使 total loss 翻倍。\n448\t\n449\t    best_loss 出现在 16-18K 步 (比 λ=0.005 的 10-26K 更早), 因为高 lambda\n450\t\n451\t    使训练更不稳定, 过拟合/振荡更早出现。两个 seed 的 loss 轨迹相似,\n452\t\n453\t    seed1 略好因为随机初始化差异。训练稳定, 无梯度爆炸。\n454\t\n455\t    '\n456\t  tables: []\n457\t  figures_description: []\n458\t  analysis: '训练完成但 loss 明显高于低 lambda 配置。高 SDF penalty 压制了 action loss\n459\t\n460\t    优化, 预期 eval 时 TSR 进一步下降。这是 \"dose-response\" 的训练侧信号:\n461\t\n462\t    更强的几何约束 = 更高的 total loss = 更大的 task 性能牺牲。\n463\t\n464\t    '\n465\t- name: Lambda=0.1 eval (2 seeds)\n466\t  plan_id: plan_010\n467\t  description: Lambda=0.1 训练完成后 eval, 验证 lambda 递增是否 monotonic 提升 CAR\n468\t  expected_results:\n469\t    seed0_avg_CAR: 57\n470\t    seed0_avg_TSR: 4\n471\t    seed0_ee_disp: 0.445\n472\t    seed1_avg_CAR: 60\n473\t    seed1_avg_TSR: 4\n474\t    seed1_ee_disp: 0.458\n475\t    two_seed_mean_CAR: 58.5\n476\t    two_seed_mean_TSR: 4.0\n477\t    seed0_task0_CAR: 72\n478\t    seed0_task0_TSR: 0\n479\t    seed0_task1_CAR: 46\n480\t    seed0_task1_TSR: 16\n481\t    seed0_task2_CAR: 90\n482\t    seed0_task2_TSR: 0\n483\t    seed0_task3_CAR: 20\n484\t    seed0_task3_TSR: 0\n485\t    seed1_task0_CAR: 70\n486\t    seed1_task0_TSR: 2\n487\t    seed1_task1_CAR: 50\n488\t    seed1_task1_TSR: 14\n489\t    seed1_task2_CAR: 92\n490\t    seed1_task2_TSR: 0\n491\t    seed1_task3_CAR: 28\n492\t    seed1_task3_TSR: 0\n493\t    lambda_curve_slope_pp_per_001lambda: 0.75\n494\t    frozen_pct: 0\n495\t  result_rationale: 'Lambda=0.1 CAR=58.5% 高于 λ=0.005 (50.5%) 和 λ=0.01 (52.7%), 呈现弱\n496\t\n497\t    dose-response: 20× lambda 增幅 → +6pp CAR。机制: 更高的 SDF penalty 迫使\n498\t\n499\t    模型在训练中更强地回避障碍物区域, 产生更保守的 action distribution。\n500\t\n501\t\n502\t    但这个 dose-response 是 sublinear 的: λ 从 0.005→0.01 (2×) 只带来 +2pp;\n503\t\n504\t    λ 从 0.01→0.1 (10×) 带来 +6pp。边际收益递减。且 TSR 从 ~7% 下降到 4%,\n505\t\n506\t    说明更高的 CAR 以更多 task 性能为代价。\n507\t\n508\t\n509\t    Per-task pattern 保持一致 (milk 最高, bbq_sauce 最低), 说明 CAR 分布\n510\t\n511\t    仍由任务布局主导而非 SDF 强度。task0 (orange_juice) CAR 从 ~60%→70%\n512\t\n513\t    提升最大, 可能因为该任务的障碍物位置恰好在 SDF gradient 能有效作用的区域。\n514\t\n515\t\n516\t    统计上: 2-seed 的 SE ≈ 2.1pp, 与 LoRA 3-seed mean (52.8%) 的差异\n517\t\n518\t    = 58.5 - 52.8 = 5.7pp, t ≈ 1.2, p ≈ 0.15 (one-sided)。在 [0.1, 0.3]\n519\t\n520\t    范围内——有 trend 但不显著。这正是 median tier 的 \"弱信号\": 无法断言\n521\t\n522\t    SDF 在高 lambda 下完全无效, 但效应边缘且代价 (TSR 进一步下降) 使其\n523\t\n524\t    实际无意义。\n525\t\n526\t    '\n527\t  tables:\n528\t  - name: 4-Point Lambda Dose-Response Curve\n529\t    columns:\n530\t    - Lambda\n531\t    - CAR Mean (%)\n532\t    - CAR SD\n533\t    - TSR Mean (%)\n534\t    - n_seeds\n535\t    - Delta vs LoRA\n536\t    rows:\n537\t    - - 0 (LoRA-only)\n538\t      - '52.8'\n539\t      - '4.2'\n540\t      - '5.8'\n541\t      - '3'\n542\t      - ref\n543\t    - - '0.005'\n544\t      - '50.5'\n545\t      - '3.0'\n546\t      - '6.8'\n547\t      - '3'\n548\t      - '-2.3'\n549\t    - - '0.01'\n550\t      - '52.7'\n551\t      - '0.3'\n552\t      - '7.0'\n553\t      - '3'\n554\t      - '-0.1'\n555\t    - - '0.1'\n556\t      - '58.5'\n557\t      - '2.1'\n558\t      - '4.0'\n559\t      - '2'\n560\t      - '+5.7'\n561\t  - name: Lambda=0.1 Per-Task Breakdown (2 seeds)\n562\t    columns:\n563\t    - Task\n564\t    - s0 CAR\n565\t    - s0 TSR\n566\t    - s1 CAR\n567\t    - s1 TSR\n568\t    - Mean CAR\n569\t    rows:\n570\t    - - orange_juice\n571\t      - '72'\n572\t      - '0'\n573\t      - '70'\n574\t      - '2'\n575\t      - '71'\n576\t    - - chocolate_pudding\n577\t      - '46'\n578\t      - '16'\n579\t      - '50'\n580\t      - '14'\n581\t      - '48'\n582\t    - - milk\n583\t      - '90'\n584\t      - '0'\n585\t      - '92'\n586\t      - '0'\n587\t      - '91'\n588\t    - - bbq_sauce\n589\t      - '20'\n590\t      - '0'\n591\t      - '28'\n592\t      - '0'\n593\t      - '24'\n594\t    - - Mean\n595\t      - '57'\n596\t      - '4'\n597\t      - '60'\n598\t      - '4'\n599\t      - '58.5'\n600\t  figures_description:\n601\t  - 'Lambda-CAR curve: x-axis = lambda (log scale, 0.005-0.1), y-axis = CAR (%). 含\n602\t    LoRA baseline 水平虚线 (52.8%). 展示非线性 dose-response, λ=0.1 处斜率开始上翘但仍在 LoRA±SE 范围内'\n603\t  - 'Lambda-TSR curve: 同 x-axis, y-axis = TSR (%). 展示 TSR 随 lambda 递减的趋势 (7% → 4%),\n604\t    说明 CAR gain 以 TSR loss 为代价'\n605\t  - 'CAR-TSR tradeoff scatter (Fig 5 候选): 每个 lambda 点画一个点, 连线展示 pareto frontier 方向'\n606\t  analysis: 'Lambda dose-response 存在但很弱: regression slope = 0.75 pp/0.01λ (在 [0.5,\n607\t    2.0]\n608\t\n609\t    范围内)。关键 insight: SDF geometric supervision 在极端 lambda 下能\"挤出\"\n610\t\n611\t    额外 ~6pp CAR, 但 (1) 效果不显著 (p=0.15), (2) 代价是 TSR 进一步下降,\n612\t\n613\t    (3) 收益有 ceiling (已有 53% 来自 demo imitation, SDF 只加 6pp)。\n614\t\n615\t\n616\t    论文写法: \"Increasing λ from 0.01 to 0.1 yields a modest CAR increase\n617\t\n618\t    (+6pp), suggesting SDF geometric supervision can provide marginal benefit\n619\t\n620\t    at extreme penalty weights. However, this improvement is not statistically\n621\t\n622\t    significant (p=0.15, 2-seed) and comes at the cost of further task\n623\t\n624\t    performance degradation (TSR: 7%→4%). The practical value of this\n625\t\n626\t    tradeoff is negligible.\"\n627\t\n628\t\n629\t    需要 discussion 段解释 lambda ceiling: 为什么 10× lambda 只换来 6pp?\n630\t\n631\t    可能原因: (1) EE-only SDF 的 structural limitation (arm-body 碰撞不被覆盖);\n632\t\n633\t    (2) demo signal 已经 capture 了大部分可学的 avoidance behavior;\n634\t\n635\t    (3) 更高 lambda 主要 suppress 运动而非改进轨迹。\n636\t\n637\t    '\n638\t- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 additional seed (seed0)\n639\t  plan_id: plan_012\n640\t  description: 从 s0 的 10K SDF checkpoint resume with λ=0, 训练至 30K, 然后 eval\n641\t  expected_results:\n642\t    training_final_loss: 0.0124\n643\t    training_best_loss: 0.0092\n644\t    eval_avg_CAR: 58\n645\t    eval_avg_TSR: 15\n646\t    eval_n_episodes: 200\n647\t    eval_avg_ee_disp: 0.455\n648\t    eval_frozen_pct: 0\n649\t    eval_task0_CAR: 66\n650\t    eval_task0_TSR: 6\n651\t    eval_task1_CAR: 46\n652\t    eval_task1_TSR: 40\n653\t    eval_task2_CAR: 82\n654\t    eval_task2_TSR: 0\n655\t    eval_task3_CAR: 38\n656\t    eval_task3_TSR: 14\n657\t    phase2_2seed_mean_CAR: 59.5\n658\t    phase2_2seed_mean_TSR: 16.5\n659\t    phase2_vs_lora_delta: 6.7\n660\t  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 seed0 CAR=58% 与 seed2 (61%) 一致但略低, 展示 Phase 2 结果的\n661\t\n662\t    seed-to-seed variance (~3pp)。两个 Phase 2 seed 的均值 = 59.5%, 比\n663\t\n664\t    LoRA-only (52.8%) 高 6.7pp。\n665\t\n666\t\n667\t    这个 delta 与 Lambda=0.1 的 delta (+5.7pp) 处于同一量级, 暗示两种路径\n668\t\n669\t    (持久效应 vs 强 penalty) 达到相似的 marginal effect ceiling。但 Phase 2\n670\t\n671\t    的 TSR 恢复更好 (16.5% vs 4%), 因为 Phase 2 在 λ=0 阶段有机会重新\n672\t\n673\t    优化 task completion, 而 λ=0.1 始终被高 SDF penalty 压制。\n674\t\n675\t\n676\t    关键: 2-seed Phase 2 的 within-condition variance (SD ≈ 2pp) 比 LoRA\n677\t\n678\t    3-seed variance (SD = 4.2pp) 小, 但因为 n=2 的自由度极低, 统计功效\n679\t\n680\t    不足以做可靠推断。Phase 2 vs LoRA 的 t-test 给出 p ≈ 0.12 (one-sided),\n681\t\n682\t    在 [0.1, 0.3] 边界——suggestive but not conclusive。\n683\t\n684\t    '\n685\t  tables:\n686\t  - name: Phase 2 Multi-Seed Summary\n687\t    columns:\n688\t    - Phase 2 Seed\n689\t    - CAR (%)\n690\t    - TSR (%)\n691\t    - EE Disp (m)\n692\t    rows:\n693\t    - - seed2 (from s2 10K ckpt)\n694\t      - '61'\n695\t      - '18'\n696\t      - '0.462'\n697\t    - - seed0 (from s0 10K ckpt)\n698\t      - '58'\n699\t      - '15'\n700\t      - '0.455'\n701\t    - - Mean\n702\t      - '59.5'\n703\t      - '16.5'\n704\t      - '0.459'\n705\t  - name: Phase 2 Persistence Comparison\n706\t    columns:\n707\t    - Condition\n708\t    - CAR (%)\n709\t    - TSR (%)\n710\t    - Delta CAR vs LoRA\n711\t    - p (one-sided)\n712\t    rows:\n713\t    - - LoRA-only (3 seeds)\n714\t      - '52.8'\n715\t      - '5.8'\n716\t      - ref\n717\t      - ref\n718\t    - - SDF lambda=0.005 30K (3 seeds)\n719\t      - '50.5'\n720\t      - '6.8'\n721\t      - '-2.3'\n722\t      - '0.24'\n723\t    - - SDF lambda=0.01 30K (3 seeds)\n724\t      - '52.7'\n725\t      - '7.0'\n726\t      - '-0.1'\n727\t      - '0.48'\n728\t    - - Phase 2 (2 seeds)\n729\t      - '59.5'\n730\t      - '16.5'\n731\t      - '+6.7'\n732\t      - '0.12'\n733\t    - - Lambda=0.1 (2 seeds)\n734\t      - '58.5'\n735\t      - '4.0'\n736\t      - '+5.7'\n737\t      - '0.15'\n738\t  figures_description:\n739\t  - 'Bar chart: 5 conditions (LoRA, SDF 0.005, SDF 0.01, Phase 2, Lambda=0.1) 的 CAR/TSR\n740\t    side-by-side, 展示 Phase 2 和 Lambda=0.1 的 marginal CAR gain 但 TSR 仍坍缩'\n741\t  analysis: 'Phase 2 的 2-seed 均值 (59.5%) 确认弱持久效应。但效应量 (~7pp) 在\n742\t\n743\t    eval noise 范围内 (单次 eval ±3-5pp), 且 n=2 功效不足。\n744\t\n745\t\n746\t    论文写法: \"Phase 2 training (removing SDF loss after 10K steps) shows\n747\t\n748\t    a trend toward higher CAR (59.5% vs 52.8% for LoRA-only, p=0.12),\n749\t\n750\t    suggesting SDF training may leave a weak persistent imprint. However,\n751\t\n752\t    task performance remains heavily degraded (TSR=16.5% vs 73% baseline),\n753\t\n754\t    and the effect size is within the range of evaluation noise. We interpret\n755\t\n756\t    this as weak evidence of SDF persistence that does not alter our primary\n757\t\n758\t    conclusion: SDF geometric supervision provides no practically significant\n759\t\n760\t    benefit.\"\n761\t\n762\t\n763\t    Phase 2 需放在 discussion 中, 不能作为 Claim 4 的反例。Frame 为\n764\t\n765\t    \"boundary condition\" and \"future investigation direction.\"\n766\t\n767\t    '\n768\t- name: LoRA baseline seed2 (training + eval)\n769\t  plan_id: plan_013\n770\t  description: 第三个 LoRA-only seed, 使 SDF 归因对比有 3v3 seeds\n771\t  expected_results:\n772\t    training_final_loss: 0.0142\n773\t    training_best_loss: 0.0112\n774\t    training_best_step: 18000\n775\t    training_total_steps: 30000\n776\t    eval_avg_CAR: 48\n777\t    eval_avg_TSR: 5\n778\t    eval_n_episodes: 200\n779\t    eval_avg_ee_disp: 0.458\n780\t    eval_frozen_pct: 0\n781\t    eval_dfCAR_100mm: 48\n782\t    eval_task0_CAR: 54\n783\t    eval_task0_TSR: 0\n784\t    eval_task0_ee_disp: 0.472\n785\t    eval_task1_CAR: 38\n786\t    eval_task1_TSR: 18\n787\t    eval_task1_ee_disp: 0.497\n788\t    eval_task2_CAR: 78\n789\t    eval_task2_TSR: 0\n790\t    eval_task2_ee_disp: 0.521\n791\t    eval_task3_CAR: 22\n792\t    eval_task3_TSR: 2\n793\t    eval_task3_ee_disp: 0.343\n794\t    lora_3seed_mean_CAR: 52.8\n795\t    lora_3seed_sd_CAR: 4.2\n796\t    sdf_delta_l005_vs_lora: -2.3\n797\t    sdf_delta_l01_vs_lora: -0.1\n798\t    welch_t_l005: 0.78\n799\t    welch_p_l005_onesided: 0.24\n800\t    welch_t_l01: 0.07\n801\t    welch_p_l01_onesided: 0.48\n802\t  result_rationale: \"LoRA seed2 CAR=48% 低于 s0 (54.5%) 和 s1 (56%), 将 3-seed 均值拉低至\\n\\\n803\t    52.8%。这个 seed-to-seed 差异 (48-56%, range=8pp) 反映 LoRA fine-tuning\\n的随机性: 不同的 LoRA\\\n804\t    \\ adapter 初始化导致模型收敛到不同的 local optima,\\n有些 optima 更 \\\"保守\\\" (高 CAR, 低 TSR), 有些更\\\n805\t    \\ \\\"积极\\\" (低 CAR, 高 TSR)。\\n\\n具体到 seed2: task2 (milk) CAR=78% 明显低于 s0/s1 的 90-94%,\\\n806\t    \\ 这是主要\\n的差异来源。milk 任务在不同 seed 间的 CAR 变化大, 可能因为该任务的\\nobstacle 位置恰好在 action distribution\\\n807\t    \\ 的边界——微小的 policy 差异就能\\n导致 \\\"刚好碰到\\\" vs \\\"刚好避开\\\"。\\n\\n3v3 统计对比:\\n- vs SDF λ=0.005:\\\n808\t    \\ delta = -2.3pp, t=0.78, p=0.24 (one-sided)\\n  解读: LoRA 可能略优于 SDF, 但 p=0.24 不足以\\\n809\t    \\ reject \\\"无差异\\\" null\\n- vs SDF λ=0.01: delta = -0.1pp, t=0.07, p=0.48\\n  解读:\\\n810\t    \\ 几乎完全相同\\n\\n关键: 高 variance (SD=4.2pp) 来自 LoRA seed2 的异常值。SDF 3-seed 的\\nvariance\\\n811\t    \\ 更小 (λ=0.005: SD=3.0, λ=0.01: SD=0.3), 说明 SDF loss 可能\\n有 regularization 效应——压缩\\\n812\t    \\ seed-to-seed variance。但这不构成 \\\"SDF\\nis useful\\\" 的 argument, 因为 variance reduction\\\n813\t    \\ 不等于 performance gain。\\n\"\n814\t  tables:\n815\t  - name: 3v3 LoRA vs SDF Seed-Level Comparison\n816\t    columns:\n817\t    - Condition\n818\t    - Seed 0\n819\t    - Seed 1\n820\t    - Seed 2\n821\t    - Mean\n822\t    - SD\n823\t    rows:\n824\t    - - LoRA-only CAR (%)\n825\t      - '54.5'\n826\t      - '56.0'\n827\t      - '48.0'\n828\t      - '52.8'\n829\t      - '4.2'\n830\t    - - LoRA-only TSR (%)\n831\t      - '8.5'\n832\t      - '4.0'\n833\t      - '5.0'\n834\t      - '5.8'\n835\t      - '2.3'\n836\t    - - SDF l=0.005 CAR (%)\n837\t      - '47.0'\n838\t      - '51.5'\n839\t      - '53.0'\n840\t      - '50.5'\n841\t      - '3.0'\n842\t    - - SDF l=0.005 TSR (%)\n843\t      - '7.5'\n844\t      - '4.0'\n845\t      - '9.0'\n846\t      - '6.8'\n847\t      - '2.5'\n848\t    - - SDF l=0.01 CAR (%)\n849\t      - '52.5'\n850\t      - '52.5'\n851\t      - '53.0'\n852\t      - '52.7'\n853\t      - '0.3'\n854\t    - - SDF l=0.01 TSR (%)\n855\t      - '6.5'\n856\t      - '7.5'\n857\t      - '7.5'\n858\t      - '7.2'\n859\t      - '0.6'\n860\t  - name: 3v3 Statistical Tests (CAR)\n861\t    columns:\n862\t    - Comparison\n863\t    - Delta (pp)\n864\t    - Welch t\n865\t    - p (one-sided)\n866\t    - Interpretation\n867\t    rows:\n868\t    - - LoRA vs SDF l=0.005\n869\t      - '-2.3'\n870\t      - '0.78'\n871\t      - '0.24'\n872\t      - trend, not significant\n873\t    - - LoRA vs SDF l=0.01\n874\t      - '-0.1'\n875\t      - '0.07'\n876\t      - '0.48'\n877\t      - no difference\n878\t  - name: LoRA seed2 Per-Task Breakdown\n879\t    columns:\n880\t    - Task\n881\t    - CAR (%)\n882\t    - TSR (%)\n883\t    - EE Disp (m)\n884\t    rows:\n885\t    - - orange_juice\n886\t      - '54'\n887\t      - '0'\n888\t      - '0.472'\n889\t    - - chocolate_pudding\n890\t      - '38'\n891\t      - '18'\n892\t      - '0.497'\n893\t    - - milk\n894\t      - '78'\n895\t      - '0'\n896\t      - '0.521'\n897\t    - - bbq_sauce\n898\t      - '22'\n899\t      - '2'\n900\t      - '0.343'\n901\t    - - Mean\n902\t      - '48'\n903\t      - '5'\n904\t      - '0.458'\n905\t  figures_description:\n906\t  - 'Box plot: 3 LoRA seeds vs 3 SDF seeds (l=0.005 和 l=0.01), 展示 distributions 高度重叠,\n907\t    LoRA 有更大 spread'\n908\t  - 'Per-task line plot: 4 tasks × 6 conditions (3 LoRA + 3 SDF), 展示 per-task ordering\n909\t    完全一致 (milk > orange_juice > chocolate_pudding > bbq_sauce)'\n910\t  analysis: 'LoRA seed2 引入的 variance 使 3v3 对比从 \"clearly indistinguishable\" 变为\n911\t\n912\t    \"not statistically distinguishable but with a suggestive trend.\" p=0.24\n913\t\n914\t    (one-sided) 落在论文写作的 awkward zone: 不能 claim \"SDF = LoRA\"\n915\t\n916\t    (需 equivalence test, 但 n=3 功效不足), 也不能 claim \"SDF < LoRA\"\n917\t\n918\t    (p > 0.1)。\n919\t\n920\t\n921\t    论文措辞需从 D025 的 \"SDF delta = 0pp\" 调整为:\n922\t\n923\t    \"The mean CAR difference between LoRA-only (52.8±4.2%) and SDF\n924\t\n925\t    (50.5±3.0% at λ=0.005; 52.7±0.3% at λ=0.01) is not statistically\n926\t\n927\t    significant (p=0.24 and p=0.48, respectively, one-sided Welch t-test).\n928\t\n929\t    We cannot formally claim equivalence with n=3 seeds, but the effect\n930\t\n931\t    size (≤2.3pp) is well within evaluation noise and below any threshold\n932\t\n933\t    of practical significance.\"\n934\t\n935\t\n936\t    这比 \"SDF is redundant\" 弱, 但仍支持 \"SDF provides no practically\n937\t\n938\t    significant benefit\" 的 hedged claim。\n939\t\n940\t    '\n941\t- name: dfCAR threshold sensitivity analysis\n942\t  plan_id: plan_014\n943\t  description: 'CPU-only 分析: 在 delta={2mm,5mm,10mm,20mm,50mm,100mm} 上计算 dfCAR'\n944\t  expected_results:\n945\t    a1_pi0_raw_CAR: 91.5\n946\t    a1_pi0_dfCAR_2mm: 0.4\n947\t    a1_pi0_dfCAR_5mm: 0.4\n948\t    a1_pi0_dfCAR_10mm: 0.4\n949\t    a1_pi0_dfCAR_20mm: 0\n950\t    a1_pi0_dfCAR_50mm: 0\n951\t    a1_pi0_dfCAR_100mm: 0\n952\t    lora_only_raw_CAR: 52.8\n953\t    lora_only_dfCAR_all_thresholds: 52.8\n954\t    sdf_l01_raw_CAR: 52.7\n955\t    sdf_l01_dfCAR_all_thresholds: 52.7\n956\t    pi05_baseline_raw_CAR: 27.0\n957\t    pi05_baseline_dfCAR_all_thresholds: 27.0\n958\t    threshold_invariance_range: 2mm - 200mm\n959\t    min_active_ee_disp_lora: 0.239\n960\t    max_frozen_ee_disp_a1: 0.001\n961\t  result_rationale: 'dfCAR threshold 稳定的根本原因是 EE displacement 分布的极端双峰性:\n962\t\n963\t\n964\t    (1) A1 (Pi0 full fine-tune, action collapse): 所有 safe episodes 的 EE\n965\t\n966\t    displacement < 1μm (median ~5nm)。只有 3/732 safe episodes 的 disp\n967\t\n968\t    在 0.1-1mm 范围。因此, 任何 δ ≥ 2mm 都会 filter out 几乎所有 safe\n969\t\n970\t    episodes, 只留下碰撞 episodes 中的极少数。dfCAR 从 91.5% 骤降至 <1%。\n971\t\n972\t\n973\t    (2) LoRA-only / SDF (Pi0.5 fine-tune, real movement): 所有 episodes\n974\t\n975\t    的 EE displacement > 239mm (最小值)。任何 δ ≤ 200mm 都不会 filter\n976\t\n977\t    out 任何 episode。dfCAR = raw CAR, 完全不受 threshold 影响。\n978\t\n979\t\n980\t    (3) Pi0.5 baseline (no fine-tune, natural movement): 类似 LoRA/SDF,\n981\t\n982\t    所有 episodes 有高 EE displacement (geometric path safety, not action\n983\t\n984\t    collapse)。dfCAR = raw CAR。\n985\t\n986\t\n987\t    这个 \"giant gap\" (1μm vs 239mm, 6 orders of magnitude) 意味着\n988\t\n989\t    dfCAR 在 δ ∈ [2mm, 200mm] 范围内完全不变。这不是巧合, 而是 VLA\n990\t\n991\t    行为的 fundamental bimodality 的体现: 模型要么完全冻结 (action collapse),\n992\t\n993\t    要么正常运动。没有 \"partial movement\" 的中间状态。\n994\t\n995\t\n996\t    这使 dfCAR 成为一个非常 robust 的指标——不需要精心选择 threshold。\n997\t\n998\t    '\n999\t  tables:\n1000\t  - name: dfCAR Threshold Sensitivity Matrix\n1001\t    columns:\n1002\t    - Condition\n1003\t    - Raw CAR\n1004\t    - d=2mm\n1005\t    - d=5mm\n1006\t    - d=10mm\n1007\t    - d=20mm\n1008\t    - d=50mm\n1009\t    - d=100mm\n1010\t    rows:\n1011\t    - - A1 (Pi0, action collapse)\n1012\t      - '91.5'\n1013\t      - '0.4'\n1014\t      - '0.4'\n1015\t      - '0.4'\n1016\t      - '0.0'\n1017\t      - '0.0'\n1018\t      - '0.0'\n1019\t    - - LoRA-only (Pi0.5)\n1020\t      - '52.8'\n1021\t      - '52.8'\n1022\t      - '52.8'\n1023\t      - '52.8'\n1024\t      - '52.8'\n1025\t      - '52.8'\n1026\t      - '52.8'\n1027\t    - - SDF l=0.01 (Pi0.5)\n1028\t      - '52.7'\n1029\t      - '52.7'\n1030\t      - '52.7'\n1031\t      - '52.7'\n1032\t      - '52.7'\n1033\t      - '52.7'\n1034\t      - '52.7'\n1035\t    - - Pi0.5 baseline\n1036\t      - '27.0'\n1037\t      - '27.0'\n1038\t      - '27.0'\n1039\t      - '27.0'\n1040\t      - '27.0'\n1041\t      - '27.0'\n1042\t      - '27.0'\n1043\t  - name: EE Displacement Distribution Summary\n1044\t    columns:\n1045\t    - Condition\n1046\t    - Min EE Disp\n1047\t    - Median EE Disp\n1048\t    - Max EE Disp\n1049\t    - Gap Factor\n1050\t    rows:\n1051\t    - - A1 safe episodes\n1052\t      - ~5nm\n1053\t      - ~5nm\n1054\t      - 0.9mm\n1055\t      - ref\n1056\t    - - LoRA-only all episodes\n1057\t      - 239mm\n1058\t      - 420mm\n1059\t      - 780mm\n1060\t      - 239000x\n1061\t    - - SDF all episodes\n1062\t      - 245mm\n1063\t      - 415mm\n1064\t      - 765mm\n1065\t      - 245000x\n1066\t    - - Pi0.5 baseline all\n1067\t      - 110mm\n1068\t      - 150mm\n1069\t      - 580mm\n1070\t      - 110000x\n1071\t  figures_description:\n1072\t  - 'dfCAR vs threshold curve (Fig candidate): x-axis = EE displacement threshold\n1073\t    (log scale, 0.001mm to 500mm); y-axis = dfCAR (%). A1 线从 91.5% 在 ~0.1mm 处骤降至 0%;\n1074\t    其他 3 条线在整个范围内保持平坦。展示 metric 的 threshold robustness。'\n1075\t  - 'EE displacement histogram (supporting): 双 panel, 左=A1 (峰在 ~5nm), 右=LoRA-only\n1076\t    (峰在 ~420mm), 展示 6 个数量级的 gap'\n1077\t  analysis: 'dfCAR threshold stability 是论文 Claim 1 (metric contribution) 的强有力\n1078\t\n1079\t    支撑。关键信息: 研究者不需要精心调参——任何 \"reasonable\" threshold\n1080\t\n1081\t    (2mm-200mm) 都给出同样结果。这使 dfCAR 成为 community-ready 的\n1082\t\n1083\t    practical tool, 而非需要 dataset-specific calibration 的 ad hoc metric。\n1084\t\n1085\t\n1086\t    论文写法: \"We evaluate dfCAR sensitivity across thresholds spanning\n1087\t\n1088\t    two orders of magnitude (2mm–100mm). The metric is completely invariant\n1089\t\n1090\t    to threshold choice (Table X), a consequence of the extreme bimodality\n1091\t\n1092\t    of VLA end-effector displacement: action-collapsed models exhibit\n1093\t\n1094\t    displacement <1μm while genuinely active models show displacement\n1095\t\n1096\t    >200mm. This six-order-of-magnitude gap ensures dfCAR requires no\n1097\t\n1098\t    threshold tuning in practice.\"\n1099\t\n1100\t\n1101\t    这段分析不受 Claim 4 median 降级影响, 是独立的方法论贡献。\n1102\t\n1103\t    '\n1104\t- name: spatial_bowl LoRA-only control (NOT COMPLETED)\n1105\t  plan_id: plan_015\n1106\t  description: 在 spatial_bowl 训练 LoRA-only (无 SDF), 完成跨场景 SDF 归因\n1107\t  expected_results:\n1108\t    status: not_completed\n1109\t    reason: GPU 资源耗尽, P1 优先级低于 Phase 2 additional seed 和 Lambda=0.1 eval\n1110\t    hypothetical_CAR_if_run: 30\n1111\t    hypothetical_TSR_if_run: 2\n1112\t    hypothetical_sdf_delta_spatial: 5\n1113\t  result_rationale: '在 median tier 下, plan_015 未能在 deadline 前完成。原因:\n1114\t\n1115\t    (1) plan_015 是 P1 优先级, 排在 P0 实验 (Phase 2 additional seed, LoRA seed2) 后面;\n1116\t\n1117\t    (2) 依赖 plan_007 (spatial_bowl SDF 训练) 先完成, 再占用 GPU 训练 34h;\n1118\t\n1119\t    (3) 在 plan_007 完成时, 可用 GPU 已被 Lambda=0.1 eval 和 Phase 2 eval 占用;\n1120\t\n1121\t    (4) 剩余 GPU 时间不足以完成 34h 训练 + eval。\n1122\t\n1123\t\n1124\t    如果能运行, 预测 spatial_bowl LoRA-only CAR ≈ 30% (接近但略低于 SDF 的 35%)。\n1125\t\n1126\t    差异 ~5pp 无法判断是 SDF 贡献还是 seed noise, 因为只有 1 seed 且无统计功效。\n1127\t\n1128\t\n1129\t    缺失后果: 论文无法做跨场景 SDF attribution。spatial_bowl 结果只能作为\n1130\t\n1131\t    \"SDF+LoRA achieves 35% CAR on spatial_bowl, consistent with real avoidance\"\n1132\t\n1133\t    的观察性报告, 不能声称 \"SDF contributes Xpp in spatial_bowl.\"\n1134\t\n1135\t    '\n1136\t  tables:\n1137\t  - name: spatial_bowl Attribution Gap\n1138\t    columns:\n1139\t    - Scene\n1140\t    - SDF+LoRA CAR\n1141\t    - LoRA-only CAR\n1142\t    - SDF Delta\n1143\t    - Attribution Possible?\n1144\t    rows:\n1145\t    - - object_pudding\n1146\t      - 50.5%\n1147\t      - 52.8%\n1148\t      - -2.3pp\n1149\t      - Yes (3v3)\n1150\t    - - spatial_bowl\n1151\t      - 35%\n1152\t      - N/A\n1153\t      - N/A\n1154\t      - No (missing control)\n1155\t  figures_description: []\n1156\t  analysis: 'plan_015 未完成是 median tier 的 structural limitation。论文需在 limitations\n1157\t\n1158\t    section 承认: \"Cross-scene SDF attribution was not possible for spatial_bowl\n1159\t\n1160\t    due to the absence of a LoRA-only control. The 35% CAR observed with SDF+LoRA\n1161\t\n1162\t    on spatial_bowl may be entirely attributable to LoRA fine-tuning, as was the\n1163\t\n1164\t    case for object_pudding.\"\n1165\t\n1166\t\n1167\t    这不影响 Claim 4 的核心 (object_pudding 的 3v3 归因仍成立), 但限制了\n1168\t\n1169\t    generalizability argument。reviewer 可能会 flag 这个 gap, 但对于一个\n1170\t\n1171\t    \"predominantly negative\" 的 finding, 跨场景泛化不是 critical requirement\n1172\t\n1173\t    ——\"SDF is redundant in one scene\" 已经是有价值的 negative finding。'\n1174\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e6dd661-5539-4780-b46e-9be6f0e5cc6e","uuid":"88375599-1fa7-4d13-a7b0-452bf9db8f22","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:25:27.640Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260526T023936/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 4 从 \"SDF is redundant\" 降级为 \"SDF is largely redundant at\n  typical lambda\n\n  (≤0.01); extreme lambda (0.1) shows marginal, statistically ambiguous CAR benefit\n\n  (~+6pp) that does not justify added complexity.\" Phase 2 弱持久性信号需承认但 frame\n\n  为 \"weak and practically insignificant — TSR remains collapsed at 16.5%.\"\n\n  LoRA seed2 拉低 3-seed 均值至 52.8%，3v3 one-sided p=0.24，无法 claim \"statistically\n\n  indistinguishable\" 但差异无实际意义。论文叙事从 \"clean negative\" 变为 \"predominantly\n\n  negative with boundary conditions.\" Claims 1-3 不受影响。dfCAR threshold 在\n\n  δ∈[2mm,200mm] 完全稳定。spatial_bowl 缺少 LoRA control 无法做跨场景 SDF 归因。\n\n  CoRL 估算 45-55%。需补充一段 discussion 解释 lambda dose-response 的 ceiling\n\n  和 practical implications。Claim 4 措辞加 hedging: \"largely redundant\" /\n\n  \"provides no practically significant benefit at standard hyperparameter ranges.\"\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: LoRA baseline eval (2 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: LoRA-only (无 SDF) 30K checkpoint eval, 2 seeds × 200 episodes\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_avg_CAR: 54.5\n    seed0_avg_TSR: 8.5\n    seed0_avg_ee_disp: 0.489\n    seed0_frozen_pct: 0\n    seed1_avg_CAR: 56.0\n    seed1_avg_TSR: 4.0\n    seed1_avg_ee_disp: 0.467\n    seed1_frozen_pct: 0\n    two_seed_mean_CAR: 55.25\n    two_seed_mean_TSR: 6.25\n    dfCAR_100mm: 55.25\n    fake_safety: false\n  result_rationale: '已确认数据。LoRA fine-tuning on collision-free demonstrations 产生真实碰撞避免:\n\n    EE displacement ~0.48m 证实机器人正常运动 (非 action collapse), frozen_pct=0%,\n\n    dfCAR = raw CAR (无 filtering)。CAR=55% 代表 +29pp vs Pi0.5 baseline (27%),\n\n    完全来自隐式 demo 信号而非几何监督。TSR 从 73% 坍缩至 6.25% 是 catastrophic\n\n    forgetting 的结果——模型学会了保守行为 (conservative avoidance) 而非真正的安全\n\n    感知 (safety awareness)。两个 seed 间 CAR 差异 1.5pp 在评估噪声范围内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: LoRA-only Per-Task Breakdown (2 seeds)\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - s0 CAR\n    - s0 TSR\n    - s0 EE Disp\n    - s1 CAR\n    - s1 TSR\n    - s1 EE Disp\n    rows:\n    - - orange_juice\n      - '62'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.497'\n      - '58'\n      - '2'\n      - '0.483'\n    - - chocolate_pudding\n      - '44'\n      - '34'\n      - '0.504'\n      - '50'\n      - '14'\n      - '0.538'\n    - - milk\n      - '94'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.577'\n      - '90'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.482'\n    - - bbq_sauce\n      - '18'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.377'\n      - '26'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.365'\n    - - Mean\n      - '54.5'\n      - '8.5'\n      - '0.489'\n      - '56.0'\n      - '4.0'\n      - '0.467'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 4-task CAR for LoRA s0 vs s1, 展示 per-task pattern 一致性 (milk 最高, bbq_sauce\n    最低)'\n  analysis: 'LoRA-only 已建立真实避障 baseline: CAR=55%, 0% fake safety, EE disp ~0.48m。\n\n    Per-task pattern 由任务布局决定 (milk 障碍物位置有利, bbq_sauce 障碍物遮挡严重),\n\n    这一 pattern 在 SDF 模型中完全复制——进一步说明 CAR 来源是 demo imitation 而非\n\n    geometric supervision。2-seed 数据足以建立 baseline, 但 3v3 统计对比需 seed2。\n\n    '\n- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 training (seed2)\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 从 train_pi05_a1_obj_s2_l005 的 10K SDF checkpoint resume, λ=0 训练至 30K\n  expected_results:\n    final_loss: 0.0118\n    best_loss: 0.0089\n    best_step: 22000\n    total_steps: 30000\n    grad_norm: 0.112\n    time_per_step: 4.6\n    training_stable: true\n  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 从已有 SDF imprint 的 10K checkpoint 出发, 移除 SDF loss (λ=0)\n    继续训练\n\n    20K 步。loss 从 ~0.015 (10K SDF 的 total_loss) 下降到 ~0.012, 因为移除 SDF\n\n    auxiliary loss 后模型只需优化 action loss, 训练变得更容易。但 loss 不会降到\n\n    LoRA-only 水平 (0.010) 因为 10K 步 SDF 训练已改变了模型的 representation\n\n    landscape, 后续优化在不同的 basin 中进行。best_loss 出现在 22K 步 (即 Phase 2\n\n    的 12K 步处), 之后因缺乏 demo 多样性而轻微过拟合。训练稳定, 无 NaN 或梯度爆炸。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '训练成功完成。loss 轨迹确认 SDF removal 后模型能正常优化, 但 loss 轨迹\n\n    与 LoRA-only 不同, 暗示 SDF 训练确实改变了 model 的 loss landscape。\n\n    '\n- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 eval (seed2)\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: Phase 2 训练完成后 eval, 200 episodes, 提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement\n  expected_results:\n    avg_CAR: 61\n    avg_TSR: 18\n    n_episodes: 200\n    avg_ee_disp: 0.462\n    frozen_pct: 0\n    dfCAR_100mm: 61\n    task0_CAR: 68\n    task0_TSR: 10\n    task0_ee_disp: 0.478\n    task1_CAR: 48\n    task1_TSR: 48\n    task1_ee_disp: 0.502\n    task2_CAR: 86\n    task2_TSR: 2\n    task2_ee_disp: 0.542\n    task3_CAR: 42\n    task3_TSR: 12\n    task3_ee_disp: 0.326\n  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 CAR=61% 高于 LoRA-only (55%) 和 SDF 30K (50.5%), 暗示 SDF\n    留下了弱\n\n    持久效应。机制解释: 10K 步 SDF 训练在模型 intermediate representations 中\n\n    编码了微弱的几何距离感知, 当 SDF loss 移除后, 这些 representations 部分保留\n\n    (不被后续训练完全覆盖), 产生略高的碰撞避免率。\n\n\n    但这个 +6pp 效应在统计上模糊: 单 seed 评估的 eval noise 约 ±3-5pp (参见\n\n    s0 λ=0.005 两次评估差 3pp)。需要 plan_012 的第二个 Phase 2 seed 确认。\n\n\n    TSR=18% 部分恢复 (vs SDF 30K 的 ~7% 和 baseline 的 73%): 移除 SDF loss\n\n    允许模型在后续 20K 步中部分重新学习 task completion, 但起始点 (10K SDF\n\n    checkpoint) 已经严重偏离 task-optimal trajectory, 恢复有限。task1 (chocolate_pudding)\n\n    恢复最好 (TSR=48%) 因为该任务最 \"可学\" (baseline TSR=86%); task2 (milk)\n\n    几乎不恢复 (TSR=2%) 因为其 CAR 已经很高 (86%), 模型选择保持保守。\n\n\n    关键: 即使 Phase 2 CAR 偏高, TSR=18% 仍远低于实用要求, 说明 two-phase strategy\n\n    (先学 safety → 再恢复 task) 在当前训练量和 LoRA 配置下不可行。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Phase 2 vs LoRA-only vs SDF 30K 对比\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - CAR (%)\n    - TSR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    - Fake Safe\n    - Seeds\n    rows:\n    - - Pi0.5 baseline\n      - '27.0'\n      - '74.7'\n      - '0.15'\n      - 98.2%\n      - '3'\n    - - LoRA-only 30K\n      - '52.8'\n      - '5.8'\n      - '0.48'\n      - 0%\n      - 3*\n    - - SDF lambda=0.005 30K\n      - '50.5'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '0.48'\n      - 0%\n      - '3'\n    - - SDF lambda=0.01 30K\n      - '52.7'\n      - '7.0'\n      - '0.48'\n      - 0%\n      - '3'\n    - - Phase 2 (10K SDF -> 20K lambda=0)\n      - '61.0'\n      - '18.0'\n      - '0.46'\n      - 0%\n      - '1'\n  - name: Phase 2 Per-Task Breakdown (seed2)\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - CAR (%)\n    - TSR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    rows:\n    - - orange_juice\n      - '68'\n      - '10'\n      - '0.478'\n    - - chocolate_pudding\n      - '48'\n      - '48'\n      - '0.502'\n    - - milk\n      - '86'\n      - '2'\n      - '0.542'\n    - - bbq_sauce\n      - '42'\n      - '12'\n      - '0.326'\n    - - Mean\n      - '61'\n      - '18'\n      - '0.462'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: CAR/TSR for LoRA-only vs SDF 30K vs Phase 2, 显示 Phase 2 的\n    CAR 略高但 TSR 仍坍缩'\n  - 'Per-task scatter: Phase 2 per-task CAR vs LoRA-only per-task CAR, 预期 Phase 2\n    全面略高但保持同样的 task ordering'\n  analysis: 'Phase 2 呈现弱 persistence 信号: CAR 比 LoRA-only 高 ~6pp, TSR 部分恢复至 18%。\n\n    但单 seed 不足以做统计推断。这个结果需要 hedging: \"Phase 2 shows a trend toward\n\n    weak SDF persistence, but with n=1 and evaluation noise of ±5pp, the effect is\n\n    not statistically reliable.\" TSR=18% 远低于 baseline 73%, 说明 two-phase strategy\n\n    在当前配置下不具实用性。论文中应放在 discussion 而非 main results。\n\n    '\n- name: spatial_bowl A1 SDF training\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF (λ=0.005) on spatial_bowl scene, seed0, 30K steps\n  expected_results:\n    final_loss: 0.0152\n    best_loss: 0.0128\n    best_step: 20000\n    total_steps: 30000\n    grad_norm: 0.18\n    time_per_step: 4.8\n    training_stable: true\n  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl 场景的 loss 高于 object_pudding (0.013 vs 0.008) 因为:\n    (1) spatial\n\n    tasks 涉及更复杂的操作路径 (在 plate/ramekin 间取碗), action 预测难度更高;\n\n    (2) SDF loss 在 spatial 场景中贡献更大 (更多 close-proximity 情况), 推高\n\n    total loss。训练稳定, 无异常。best_loss 出现在 20K 步而非 26K, 因为 spatial\n\n    场景的 SDF loss 使训练曲线更不稳定, 过拟合更早出现。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '训练成功完成。spatial_bowl 训练的 loss 比 object_pudding 高约 60%, 反映场景\n\n    复杂度差异。跨场景 SDF 效果归因需要 plan_015 (LoRA-only control) 完成,\n\n    但在 median tier 下 plan_015 不会在 deadline 前完成。\n\n    '\n- name: spatial_bowl SDF eval\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: spatial_bowl A1 训练完成后 eval, 200 episodes, 验证跨场景 CAR/TSR pattern\n  expected_results:\n    avg_CAR: 35\n    avg_TSR: 3\n    n_episodes: 200\n    avg_ee_disp: 0.248\n    frozen_pct: 0\n    fake_safety: false\n    task0_CAR: 38\n    task0_TSR: 4\n    task0_ee_disp: 0.263\n    task1_CAR: 28\n    task1_TSR: 0\n    task1_ee_disp: 0.231\n    task2_CAR: 48\n    task2_TSR: 6\n    task2_ee_disp: 0.274\n    task3_CAR: 26\n    task3_TSR: 2\n    task3_ee_disp: 0.224\n  result_rationale: 'spatial_bowl SDF CAR=35% 显著低于 object_pudding SDF (50.5%), 原因:\n\n    (1) spatial_bowl 任务布局更紧凑——碗被 plate/ramekin/stove 环绕, 机械臂\n\n    几乎不可能在不碰触障碍物的情况下完成 pick 动作; (2) 碰撞类型以 arm-body\n\n    为主 (EE-only SDF 无法防护); (3) 障碍物体积更大且更密集。\n\n\n    EE displacement ~0.25m 低于 object_pudding (0.48m) 因为 spatial tasks 的\n\n    操作空间更小, 机械臂运动范围受限。fake_safety=0% 确认 SDF LoRA 在\n\n    spatial_bowl 也产生真实运动。\n\n\n    task2 (pick_bowl_on_stove) CAR 最高 (48%) 因为 stove 上方空间较大,\n\n    碰撞风险较低; task3 (pick_bowl_on_cabinet) CAR 最低 (26%) 因为 cabinet\n\n    两侧有遮挡。TSR=3% 极低, 与 object_pudding 的 TSR=7% 一致——都是\n\n    catastrophic forgetting, spatial 更严重因为任务本身更难 (baseline TSR=57.5%)。\n\n\n    关键限制: 没有 spatial_bowl LoRA-only control (plan_015), 无法判断这\n\n    35% CAR 是 SDF 贡献还是 LoRA-only 就能达到。如果 spatial LoRA-only\n\n    CAR 也 ~35%, 则进一步确认 SDF 冗余; 如果 CAR ~26% (接近 baseline),\n\n    则 SDF 可能在 spatial 场景有 +9pp 效应——但无法验证。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: spatial_bowl Per-Task Breakdown\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - CAR (%)\n    - TSR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    rows:\n    - - bowl_between_plate_ramekin\n      - '38'\n      - '4'\n      - '0.263'\n    - - bowl_on_ramekin\n      - '28'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.231'\n    - - bowl_on_stove\n      - '48'\n      - '6'\n      - '0.274'\n    - - bowl_on_cabinet\n      - '26'\n      - '2'\n      - '0.224'\n    - - Mean\n      - '35'\n      - '3'\n      - '0.248'\n  - name: 跨场景对比 (SDF lambda=0.005)\n    columns:\n    - Scene\n    - CAR (%)\n    - TSR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    - LoRA Control?\n    rows:\n    - - object_pudding\n      - '50.5'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '0.48'\n      - Yes (3 seeds)\n    - - spatial_bowl\n      - '35'\n      - '3'\n      - '0.25'\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side per-task CAR bar chart: object_pudding vs spatial_bowl, 展示 CAR 在\n    spatial 场景系统性下降'\n  analysis: 'spatial_bowl 数据展示 SDF+LoRA 的跨场景泛化, 但因缺少 LoRA-only control\n\n    (plan_015), 无法做 SDF 归因。在论文中只能呈现为 \"SDF+LoRA in spatial_bowl\n\n    achieves 35% CAR with 0% fake safety\" 而不能说 \"SDF contributes Xpp.\"\n\n    这是 median tier 的关键 gap: 跨场景 SDF attribution 缺失。\n\n    建议: 论文放在 appendix 作为跨场景泛化的 preliminary observation, 而非\n\n    main claim 的 evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: Lambda=0.1 bracket training (2 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF (λ=0.1) on object_pudding, s0+s1, 30K steps each\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_final_loss: 0.0385\n    seed0_best_loss: 0.0312\n    seed0_best_step: 16000\n    seed1_final_loss: 0.0371\n    seed1_best_loss: 0.0298\n    seed1_best_step: 18000\n    total_steps: 30000\n    training_stable: true\n  result_rationale: 'λ=0.1 的 total loss 显著高于 λ=0.005/0.01 (0.038 vs 0.014) 因为 SDF\n\n    auxiliary loss 在高 lambda 下成为 dominant loss component。action_loss 本身\n\n    可能只有 ~0.012, 但 SDF loss × 0.1 贡献 ~0.025, 使 total loss 翻倍。\n\n    best_loss 出现在 16-18K 步 (比 λ=0.005 的 10-26K 更早), 因为高 lambda\n\n    使训练更不稳定, 过拟合/振荡更早出现。两个 seed 的 loss 轨迹相似,\n\n    seed1 略好因为随机初始化差异。训练稳定, 无梯度爆炸。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '训练完成但 loss 明显高于低 lambda 配置。高 SDF penalty 压制了 action loss\n\n    优化, 预期 eval 时 TSR 进一步下降。这是 \"dose-response\" 的训练侧信号:\n\n    更强的几何约束 = 更高的 total loss = 更大的 task 性能牺牲。\n\n    '\n- name: Lambda=0.1 eval (2 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: Lambda=0.1 训练完成后 eval, 验证 lambda 递增是否 monotonic 提升 CAR\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_avg_CAR: 57\n    seed0_avg_TSR: 4\n    seed0_ee_disp: 0.445\n    seed1_avg_CAR: 60\n    seed1_avg_TSR: 4\n    seed1_ee_disp: 0.458\n    two_seed_mean_CAR: 58.5\n    two_seed_mean_TSR: 4.0\n    seed0_task0_CAR: 72\n    seed0_task0_TSR: 0\n    seed0_task1_CAR: 46\n    seed0_task1_TSR: 16\n    seed0_task2_CAR: 90\n    seed0_task2_TSR: 0\n    seed0_task3_CAR: 20\n    seed0_task3_TSR: 0\n    seed1_task0_CAR: 70\n    seed1_task0_TSR: 2\n    seed1_task1_CAR: 50\n    seed1_task1_TSR: 14\n    seed1_task2_CAR: 92\n    seed1_task2_TSR: 0\n    seed1_task3_CAR: 28\n    seed1_task3_TSR: 0\n    lambda_curve_slope_pp_per_001lambda: 0.75\n    frozen_pct: 0\n  result_rationale: 'Lambda=0.1 CAR=58.5% 高于 λ=0.005 (50.5%) 和 λ=0.01 (52.7%), 呈现弱\n\n    dose-response: 20× lambda 增幅 → +6pp CAR。机制: 更高的 SDF penalty 迫使\n\n    模型在训练中更强地回避障碍物区域, 产生更保守的 action distribution。\n\n\n    但这个 dose-response 是 sublinear 的: λ 从 0.005→0.01 (2×) 只带来 +2pp;\n\n    λ 从 0.01→0.1 (10×) 带来 +6pp。边际收益递减。且 TSR 从 ~7% 下降到 4%,\n\n    说明更高的 CAR 以更多 task 性能为代价。\n\n\n    Per-task pattern 保持一致 (milk 最高, bbq_sauce 最低), 说明 CAR 分布\n\n    仍由任务布局主导而非 SDF 强度。task0 (orange_juice) CAR 从 ~60%→70%\n\n    提升最大, 可能因为该任务的障碍物位置恰好在 SDF gradient 能有效作用的区域。\n\n\n    统计上: 2-seed 的 SE ≈ 2.1pp, 与 LoRA 3-seed mean (52.8%) 的差异\n\n    = 58.5 - 52.8 = 5.7pp, t ≈ 1.2, p ≈ 0.15 (one-sided)。在 [0.1, 0.3]\n\n    范围内——有 trend 但不显著。这正是 median tier 的 \"弱信号\": 无法断言\n\n    SDF 在高 lambda 下完全无效, 但效应边缘且代价 (TSR 进一步下降) 使其\n\n    实际无意义。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 4-Point Lambda Dose-Response Curve\n    columns:\n    - Lambda\n    - CAR Mean (%)\n    - CAR SD\n    - TSR Mean (%)\n    - n_seeds\n    - Delta vs LoRA\n    rows:\n    - - 0 (LoRA-only)\n      - '52.8'\n      - '4.2'\n      - '5.8'\n      - '3'\n      - ref\n    - - '0.005'\n      - '50.5'\n      - '3.0'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '3'\n      - '-2.3'\n    - - '0.01'\n      - '52.7'\n      - '0.3'\n      - '7.0'\n      - '3'\n      - '-0.1'\n    - - '0.1'\n      - '58.5'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '4.0'\n      - '2'\n      - '+5.7'\n  - name: Lambda=0.1 Per-Task Breakdown (2 seeds)\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - s0 CAR\n    - s0 TSR\n    - s1 CAR\n    - s1 TSR\n    - Mean CAR\n    rows:\n    - - orange_juice\n      - '72'\n      - '0'\n      - '70'\n      - '2'\n      - '71'\n    - - chocolate_pudding\n      - '46'\n      - '16'\n      - '50'\n      - '14'\n      - '48'\n    - - milk\n      - '90'\n      - '0'\n      - '92'\n      - '0'\n      - '91'\n    - - bbq_sauce\n      - '20'\n      - '0'\n      - '28'\n      - '0'\n      - '24'\n    - - Mean\n      - '57'\n      - '4'\n      - '60'\n      - '4'\n      - '58.5'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Lambda-CAR curve: x-axis = lambda (log scale, 0.005-0.1), y-axis = CAR (%). 含\n    LoRA baseline 水平虚线 (52.8%). 展示非线性 dose-response, λ=0.1 处斜率开始上翘但仍在 LoRA±SE 范围内'\n  - 'Lambda-TSR curve: 同 x-axis, y-axis = TSR (%). 展示 TSR 随 lambda 递减的趋势 (7% → 4%),\n    说明 CAR gain 以 TSR loss 为代价'\n  - 'CAR-TSR tradeoff scatter (Fig 5 候选): 每个 lambda 点画一个点, 连线展示 pareto frontier 方向'\n  analysis: 'Lambda dose-response 存在但很弱: regression slope = 0.75 pp/0.01λ (在 [0.5,\n    2.0]\n\n    范围内)。关键 insight: SDF geometric supervision 在极端 lambda 下能\"挤出\"\n\n    额外 ~6pp CAR, 但 (1) 效果不显著 (p=0.15), (2) 代价是 TSR 进一步下降,\n\n    (3) 收益有 ceiling (已有 53% 来自 demo imitation, SDF 只加 6pp)。\n\n\n    论文写法: \"Increasing λ from 0.01 to 0.1 yields a modest CAR increase\n\n    (+6pp), suggesting SDF geometric supervision can provide marginal benefit\n\n    at extreme penalty weights. However, this improvement is not statistically\n\n    significant (p=0.15, 2-seed) and comes at the cost of further task\n\n    performance degradation (TSR: 7%→4%). The practical value of this\n\n    tradeoff is negligible.\"\n\n\n    需要 discussion 段解释 lambda ceiling: 为什么 10× lambda 只换来 6pp?\n\n    可能原因: (1) EE-only SDF 的 structural limitation (arm-body 碰撞不被覆盖);\n\n    (2) demo signal 已经 capture 了大部分可学的 avoidance behavior;\n\n    (3) 更高 lambda 主要 suppress 运动而非改进轨迹。\n\n    '\n- name: Phase 2 lambda=0 additional seed (seed0)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 从 s0 的 10K SDF checkpoint resume with λ=0, 训练至 30K, 然后 eval\n  expected_results:\n    training_final_loss: 0.0124\n    training_best_loss: 0.0092\n    eval_avg_CAR: 58\n    eval_avg_TSR: 15\n    eval_n_episodes: 200\n    eval_avg_ee_disp: 0.455\n    eval_frozen_pct: 0\n    eval_task0_CAR: 66\n    eval_task0_TSR: 6\n    eval_task1_CAR: 46\n    eval_task1_TSR: 40\n    eval_task2_CAR: 82\n    eval_task2_TSR: 0\n    eval_task3_CAR: 38\n    eval_task3_TSR: 14\n    phase2_2seed_mean_CAR: 59.5\n    phase2_2seed_mean_TSR: 16.5\n    phase2_vs_lora_delta: 6.7\n  result_rationale: 'Phase 2 seed0 CAR=58% 与 seed2 (61%) 一致但略低, 展示 Phase 2 结果的\n\n    seed-to-seed variance (~3pp)。两个 Phase 2 seed 的均值 = 59.5%, 比\n\n    LoRA-only (52.8%) 高 6.7pp。\n\n\n    这个 delta 与 Lambda=0.1 的 delta (+5.7pp) 处于同一量级, 暗示两种路径\n\n    (持久效应 vs 强 penalty) 达到相似的 marginal effect ceiling。但 Phase 2\n\n    的 TSR 恢复更好 (16.5% vs 4%), 因为 Phase 2 在 λ=0 阶段有机会重新\n\n    优化 task completion, 而 λ=0.1 始终被高 SDF penalty 压制。\n\n\n    关键: 2-seed Phase 2 的 within-condition variance (SD ≈ 2pp) 比 LoRA\n\n    3-seed variance (SD = 4.2pp) 小, 但因为 n=2 的自由度极低, 统计功效\n\n    不足以做可靠推断。Phase 2 vs LoRA 的 t-test 给出 p ≈ 0.12 (one-sided),\n\n    在 [0.1, 0.3] 边界——suggestive but not conclusive。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Phase 2 Multi-Seed Summary\n    columns:\n    - Phase 2 Seed\n    - CAR (%)\n    - TSR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    rows:\n    - - seed2 (from s2 10K ckpt)\n      - '61'\n      - '18'\n      - '0.462'\n    - - seed0 (from s0 10K ckpt)\n      - '58'\n      - '15'\n      - '0.455'\n    - - Mean\n      - '59.5'\n      - '16.5'\n      - '0.459'\n  - name: Phase 2 Persistence Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - CAR (%)\n    - TSR (%)\n    - Delta CAR vs LoRA\n    - p (one-sided)\n    rows:\n    - - LoRA-only (3 seeds)\n      - '52.8'\n      - '5.8'\n      - ref\n      - ref\n    - - SDF lambda=0.005 30K (3 seeds)\n      - '50.5'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '-2.3'\n      - '0.24'\n    - - SDF lambda=0.01 30K (3 seeds)\n      - '52.7'\n      - '7.0'\n      - '-0.1'\n      - '0.48'\n    - - Phase 2 (2 seeds)\n      - '59.5'\n      - '16.5'\n      - '+6.7'\n      - '0.12'\n    - - Lambda=0.1 (2 seeds)\n      - '58.5'\n      - '4.0'\n      - '+5.7'\n      - '0.15'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 5 conditions (LoRA, SDF 0.005, SDF 0.01, Phase 2, Lambda=0.1) 的 CAR/TSR\n    side-by-side, 展示 Phase 2 和 Lambda=0.1 的 marginal CAR gain 但 TSR 仍坍缩'\n  analysis: 'Phase 2 的 2-seed 均值 (59.5%) 确认弱持久效应。但效应量 (~7pp) 在\n\n    eval noise 范围内 (单次 eval ±3-5pp), 且 n=2 功效不足。\n\n\n    论文写法: \"Phase 2 training (removing SDF loss after 10K steps) shows\n\n    a trend toward higher CAR (59.5% vs 52.8% for LoRA-only, p=0.12),\n\n    suggesting SDF training may leave a weak persistent imprint. However,\n\n    task performance remains heavily degraded (TSR=16.5% vs 73% baseline),\n\n    and the effect size is within the range of evaluation noise. We interpret\n\n    this as weak evidence of SDF persistence that does not alter our primary\n\n    conclusion: SDF geometric supervision provides no practically significant\n\n    benefit.\"\n\n\n    Phase 2 需放在 discussion 中, 不能作为 Claim 4 的反例。Frame 为\n\n    \"boundary condition\" and \"future investigation direction.\"\n\n    '\n- name: LoRA baseline seed2 (training + eval)\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 第三个 LoRA-only seed, 使 SDF 归因对比有 3v3 seeds\n  expected_results:\n    training_final_loss: 0.0142\n    training_best_loss: 0.0112\n    training_best_step: 18000\n    training_total_steps: 30000\n    eval_avg_CAR: 48\n    eval_avg_TSR: 5\n    eval_n_episodes: 200\n    eval_avg_ee_disp: 0.458\n    eval_frozen_pct: 0\n    eval_dfCAR_100mm: 48\n    eval_task0_CAR: 54\n    eval_task0_TSR: 0\n    eval_task0_ee_disp: 0.472\n    eval_task1_CAR: 38\n    eval_task1_TSR: 18\n    eval_task1_ee_disp: 0.497\n    eval_task2_CAR: 78\n    eval_task2_TSR: 0\n    eval_task2_ee_disp: 0.521\n    eval_task3_CAR: 22\n    eval_task3_TSR: 2\n    eval_task3_ee_disp: 0.343\n    lora_3seed_mean_CAR: 52.8\n    lora_3seed_sd_CAR: 4.2\n    sdf_delta_l005_vs_lora: -2.3\n    sdf_delta_l01_vs_lora: -0.1\n    welch_t_l005: 0.78\n    welch_p_l005_onesided: 0.24\n    welch_t_l01: 0.07\n    welch_p_l01_onesided: 0.48\n  result_rationale: \"LoRA seed2 CAR=48% 低于 s0 (54.5%) 和 s1 (56%), 将 3-seed 均值拉低至\\n\\\n    52.8%。这个 seed-to-seed 差异 (48-56%, range=8pp) 反映 LoRA fine-tuning\\n的随机性: 不同的 LoRA\\\n    \\ adapter 初始化导致模型收敛到不同的 local optima,\\n有些 optima 更 \\\"保守\\\" (高 CAR, 低 TSR), 有些更\\\n    \\ \\\"积极\\\" (低 CAR, 高 TSR)。\\n\\n具体到 seed2: task2 (milk) CAR=78% 明显低于 s0/s1 的 90-94%,\\\n    \\ 这是主要\\n的差异来源。milk 任务在不同 seed 间的 CAR 变化大, 可能因为该任务的\\nobstacle 位置恰好在 action distribution\\\n    \\ 的边界——微小的 policy 差异就能\\n导致 \\\"刚好碰到\\\" vs \\\"刚好避开\\\"。\\n\\n3v3 统计对比:\\n- vs SDF λ=0.005:\\\n    \\ delta = -2.3pp, t=0.78, p=0.24 (one-sided)\\n  解读: LoRA 可能略优于 SDF, 但 p=0.24 不足以\\\n    \\ reject \\\"无差异\\\" null\\n- vs SDF λ=0.01: delta = -0.1pp, t=0.07, p=0.48\\n  解读:\\\n    \\ 几乎完全相同\\n\\n关键: 高 variance (SD=4.2pp) 来自 LoRA seed2 的异常值。SDF 3-seed 的\\nvariance\\\n    \\ 更小 (λ=0.005: SD=3.0, λ=0.01: SD=0.3), 说明 SDF loss 可能\\n有 regularization 效应——压缩\\\n    \\ seed-to-seed variance。但这不构成 \\\"SDF\\nis useful\\\" 的 argument, 因为 variance reduction\\\n    \\ 不等于 performance gain。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 3v3 LoRA vs SDF Seed-Level Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Seed 0\n    - Seed 1\n    - Seed 2\n    - Mean\n    - SD\n    rows:\n    - - LoRA-only CAR (%)\n      - '54.5'\n      - '56.0'\n      - '48.0'\n      - '52.8'\n      - '4.2'\n    - - LoRA-only TSR (%)\n      - '8.5'\n      - '4.0'\n      - '5.0'\n      - '5.8'\n      - '2.3'\n    - - SDF l=0.005 CAR (%)\n      - '47.0'\n      - '51.5'\n      - '53.0'\n      - '50.5'\n      - '3.0'\n    - - SDF l=0.005 TSR (%)\n      - '7.5'\n      - '4.0'\n      - '9.0'\n      - '6.8'\n      - '2.5'\n    - - SDF l=0.01 CAR (%)\n      - '52.5'\n      - '52.5'\n      - '53.0'\n      - '52.7'\n      - '0.3'\n    - - SDF l=0.01 TSR (%)\n      - '6.5'\n      - '7.5'\n      - '7.5'\n      - '7.2'\n      - '0.6'\n  - name: 3v3 Statistical Tests (CAR)\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Delta (pp)\n    - Welch t\n    - p (one-sided)\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - LoRA vs SDF l=0.005\n      - '-2.3'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.24'\n      - trend, not significant\n    - - LoRA vs SDF l=0.01\n      - '-0.1'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.48'\n      - no difference\n  - name: LoRA seed2 Per-Task Breakdown\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - CAR (%)\n    - TSR (%)\n    - EE Disp (m)\n    rows:\n    - - orange_juice\n      - '54'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.472'\n    - - chocolate_pudding\n      - '38'\n      - '18'\n      - '0.497'\n    - - milk\n      - '78'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.521'\n    - - bbq_sauce\n      - '22'\n      - '2'\n      - '0.343'\n    - - Mean\n      - '48'\n      - '5'\n      - '0.458'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Box plot: 3 LoRA seeds vs 3 SDF seeds (l=0.005 和 l=0.01), 展示 distributions 高度重叠,\n    LoRA 有更大 spread'\n  - 'Per-task line plot: 4 tasks × 6 conditions (3 LoRA + 3 SDF), 展示 per-task ordering\n    完全一致 (milk > orange_juice > chocolate_pudding > bbq_sauce)'\n  analysis: 'LoRA seed2 引入的 variance 使 3v3 对比从 \"clearly indistinguishable\" 变为\n\n    \"not statistically distinguishable but with a suggestive trend.\" p=0.24\n\n    (one-sided) 落在论文写作的 awkward zone: 不能 claim \"SDF = LoRA\"\n\n    (需 equivalence test, 但 n=3 功效不足), 也不能 claim \"SDF < LoRA\"\n\n    (p > 0.1)。\n\n\n    论文措辞需从 D025 的 \"SDF delta = 0pp\" 调整为:\n\n    \"The mean CAR difference between LoRA-only (52.8±4.2%) and SDF\n\n    (50.5±3.0% at λ=0.005; 52.7±0.3% at λ=0.01) is not statistically\n\n    significant (p=0.24 and p=0.48, respectively, one-sided Welch t-test).\n\n    We cannot formally claim equivalence with n=3 seeds, but the effect\n\n    size (≤2.3pp) is well within evaluation noise and below any threshold\n\n    of practical significance.\"\n\n\n    这比 \"SDF is redundant\" 弱, 但仍支持 \"SDF provides no practically\n\n    significant benefit\" 的 hedged claim。\n\n    '\n- name: dfCAR threshold sensitivity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: 'CPU-only 分析: 在 delta={2mm,5mm,10mm,20mm,50mm,100mm} 上计算 dfCAR'\n  expected_results:\n    a1_pi0_raw_CAR: 91.5\n    a1_pi0_dfCAR_2mm: 0.4\n    a1_pi0_dfCAR_5mm: 0.4\n    a1_pi0_dfCAR_10mm: 0.4\n    a1_pi0_dfCAR_20mm: 0\n    a1_pi0_dfCAR_50mm: 0\n    a1_pi0_dfCAR_100mm: 0\n    lora_only_raw_CAR: 52.8\n    lora_only_dfCAR_all_thresholds: 52.8\n    sdf_l01_raw_CAR: 52.7\n    sdf_l01_dfCAR_all_thresholds: 52.7\n    pi05_baseline_raw_CAR: 27.0\n    pi05_baseline_dfCAR_all_thresholds: 27.0\n    threshold_invariance_range: 2mm - 200mm\n    min_active_ee_disp_lora: 0.239\n    max_frozen_ee_disp_a1: 0.001\n  result_rationale: 'dfCAR threshold 稳定的根本原因是 EE displacement 分布的极端双峰性:\n\n\n    (1) A1 (Pi0 full fine-tune, action collapse): 所有 safe episodes 的 EE\n\n    displacement < 1μm (median ~5nm)。只有 3/732 safe episodes 的 disp\n\n    在 0.1-1mm 范围。因此, 任何 δ ≥ 2mm 都会 filter out 几乎所有 safe\n\n    episodes, 只留下碰撞 episodes 中的极少数。dfCAR 从 91.5% 骤降至 <1%。\n\n\n    (2) LoRA-only / SDF (Pi0.5 fine-tune, real movement): 所有 episodes\n\n    的 EE displacement > 239mm (最小值)。任何 δ ≤ 200mm 都不会 filter\n\n    out 任何 episode。dfCAR = raw CAR, 完全不受 threshold 影响。\n\n\n    (3) Pi0.5 baseline (no fine-tune, natural movement): 类似 LoRA/SDF,\n\n    所有 episodes 有高 EE displacement (geometric path safety, not action\n\n    collapse)。dfCAR = raw CAR。\n\n\n    这个 \"giant gap\" (1μm vs 239mm, 6 orders of magnitude) 意味着\n\n    dfCAR 在 δ ∈ [2mm, 200mm] 范围内完全不变。这不是巧合, 而是 VLA\n\n    行为的 fundamental bimodality 的体现: 模型要么完全冻结 (action collapse),\n\n    要么正常运动。没有 \"partial movement\" 的中间状态。\n\n\n    这使 dfCAR 成为一个非常 robust 的指标——不需要精心选择 threshold。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: dfCAR Threshold Sensitivity Matrix\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Raw CAR\n    - d=2mm\n    - d=5mm\n    - d=10mm\n    - d=20mm\n    - d=50mm\n    - d=100mm\n    rows:\n    - - A1 (Pi0, action collapse)\n      - '91.5'\n      - '0.4'\n      - '0.4'\n      - '0.4'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - LoRA-only (Pi0.5)\n      - '52.8'\n      - '52.8'\n      - '52.8'\n      - '52.8'\n      - '52.8'\n      - '52.8'\n      - '52.8'\n    - - SDF l=0.01 (Pi0.5)\n      - '52.7'\n      - '52.7'\n      - '52.7'\n      - '52.7'\n      - '52.7'\n      - '52.7'\n      - '52.7'\n    - - Pi0.5 baseline\n      - '27.0'\n      - '27.0'\n      - '27.0'\n      - '27.0'\n      - '27.0'\n      - '27.0'\n      - '27.0'\n  - name: EE Displacement Distribution Summary\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Min EE Disp\n    - Median EE Disp\n    - Max EE Disp\n    - Gap Factor\n    rows:\n    - - A1 safe episodes\n      - ~5nm\n      - ~5nm\n      - 0.9mm\n      - ref\n    - - LoRA-only all episodes\n      - 239mm\n      - 420mm\n      - 780mm\n      - 239000x\n    - - SDF all episodes\n      - 245mm\n      - 415mm\n      - 765mm\n      - 245000x\n    - - Pi0.5 baseline all\n      - 110mm\n      - 150mm\n      - 580mm\n      - 110000x\n  figures_description:\n  - 'dfCAR vs threshold curve (Fig candidate): x-axis = EE displacement threshold\n    (log scale, 0.001mm to 500mm); y-axis = dfCAR (%). A1 线从 91.5% 在 ~0.1mm 处骤降至 0%;\n    其他 3 条线在整个范围内保持平坦。展示 metric 的 threshold robustness。'\n  - 'EE displacement histogram (supporting): 双 panel, 左=A1 (峰在 ~5nm), 右=LoRA-only\n    (峰在 ~420mm), 展示 6 个数量级的 gap'\n  analysis: 'dfCAR threshold stability 是论文 Claim 1 (metric contribution) 的强有力\n\n    支撑。关键信息: 研究者不需要精心调参——任何 \"reasonable\" threshold\n\n    (2mm-200mm) 都给出同样结果。这使 dfCAR 成为 community-ready 的\n\n    practical tool, 而非需要 dataset-specific calibration 的 ad hoc metric。\n\n\n    论文写法: \"We evaluate dfCAR sensitivity across thresholds spanning\n\n    two orders of magnitude (2mm–100mm). The metric is completely invariant\n\n    to threshold choice (Table X), a consequence of the extreme bimodality\n\n    of VLA end-effector displacement: action-collapsed models exhibit\n\n    displacement <1μm while genuinely active models show displacement\n\n    >200mm. This six-order-of-magnitude gap ensures dfCAR requires no\n\n    threshold tuning in practice.\"\n\n\n    这段分析不受 Claim 4 median 降级影响, 是独立的方法论贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: spatial_bowl LoRA-only control (NOT COMPLETED)\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: 在 spatial_bowl 训练 LoRA-only (无 SDF), 完成跨场景 SDF 归因\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_completed\n    reason: GPU 资源耗尽, P1 优先级低于 Phase 2 additional seed 和 Lambda=0.1 eval\n    hypothetical_CAR_if_run: 30\n    hypothetical_TSR_if_run: 2\n    hypothetical_sdf_delta_spatial: 5\n  result_rationale: '在 median tier 下, plan_015 未能在 deadline 前完成。原因:\n\n    (1) plan_015 是 P1 优先级, 排在 P0 实验 (Phase 2 additional seed, LoRA seed2) 后面;\n\n    (2) 依赖 plan_007 (spatial_bowl SDF 训练) 先完成, 再占用 GPU 训练 34h;\n\n    (3) 在 plan_007 完成时, 可用 GPU 已被 Lambda=0.1 eval 和 Phase 2 eval 占用;\n\n    (4) 剩余 GPU 时间不足以完成 34h 训练 + eval。\n\n\n    如果能运行, 预测 spatial_bowl LoRA-only CAR ≈ 30% (接近但略低于 SDF 的 35%)。\n\n    差异 ~5pp 无法判断是 SDF 贡献还是 seed noise, 因为只有 1 seed 且无统计功效。\n\n\n    缺失后果: 论文无法做跨场景 SDF attribution。spatial_bowl 结果只能作为\n\n    \"SDF+LoRA achieves 35% CAR on spatial_bowl, consistent with real avoidance\"\n\n    的观察性报告, 不能声称 \"SDF contributes Xpp in spatial_bowl.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: spatial_bowl Attribution Gap\n    columns:\n    - Scene\n    - SDF+LoRA CAR\n    - LoRA-only CAR\n    - SDF Delta\n    - Attribution Possible?\n    rows:\n    - - object_pudding\n      - 50.5%\n      - 52.8%\n      - -2.3pp\n      - Yes (3v3)\n    - - spatial_bowl\n      - 35%\n      - N/A\n      - N/A\n      - No (missing control)\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'plan_015 未完成是 median tier 的 structural limitation。论文需在 limitations\n\n    section 承认: \"Cross-scene SDF attribution was not possible for spatial_bowl\n\n    due to the absence of a LoRA-only control. The 35% CAR observed with SDF+LoRA\n\n    on spatial_bowl may be entirely attributable to LoRA fine-tuning, as was the\n\n    case for object_pudding.\"\n\n\n    这不影响 Claim 4 的核心 (object_pudding 的 3v3 归因仍成立), 但限制了\n\n    generalizability argument。reviewer 可能会 flag 这个 gap, 但对于一个\n\n    \"predominantly negative\" 的 finding, 跨场景泛化不是 critical requirement\n\n    ——\"SDF is redundant in one scene\" 已经是有价值的 negative finding。'\n","numLines":1174,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1174}}}
