{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pycuj8zsFFsGMo518S67rZ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2024 instruction for reviews reviewer scoring scale rating\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056528/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL.2024 | Cool Papers - Immersive Paper Discovery\",\"url\":\"https://papers.cool/venue/CoRL.2024\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12055280/\"},{\"title\":\"Grant Peer Review: Improving Inter-Rater Reliability with Training\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4468126/\"},{\"title\":\"Best Reviewers Award for 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11955497/\"}]\n\nThe search results found the CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page, but the specific content about the reviewer scoring scale rating isn't fully visible in the excerpt. Let me search more specifically for the scoring scale details.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056528/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12055280/\"},{\"title\":\"ICML 2024 Reviewer Instructions\",\"url\":\"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerInstructions\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056554/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056555/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056527/\"}]\n\nBased on my search results, I found the CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page, but the specific reviewer scoring scale details are not fully displayed in the search results. The search returned the page title and some content about review criteria and reviewer qualifications, but the actual numerical scoring scale isn't visible in the excerpts.\n\nCoRL 2024 submissions are evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, either theoretical or empirical, and results are judged on the degree to which they have been objectively established and/or their potential for scientific and technological impact, as well as their relevance to robotic learning.\n\nHowever, the specific numerical rating scale that reviewers should use (such as whether it's 1-10, 1-5, etc., and what each score means) is not included in the search results I retrieved. To get the complete scoring scale instructions, you would need to visit the CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page directly at 2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e6dd661-5539-4780-b46e-9be6f0e5cc6e","uuid":"87aefcce-f496-4df5-a01a-01fd28e1bb17","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:25:56.255Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2024 instruction for reviews reviewer scoring scale rating","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01UarGyhQ1rQCYhnP1RnxFzm","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"titl