{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G5ezKX444yRiZt5Z5wRJzG","type":"tool_result","content":"# CoRL 2024 Review Statistics\n\n**Acceptance Rate:** 39.34% (264 accepted out of 671 total submissions)\n\n**Scoring Scale:** The page indicates a 1-4 point scale for CoRL 2024, differing from previous years.\n\n**Score Range for Accepted Papers:** \n- Minimum: 1.70\n- Maximum: 4.00\n- Average: 3.01 (std: 0.37)\n\n**Key Observation:** The data shows that \"all accepted papers received the same score distribution\" as the overall venue, suggesting all 264 accepted papers were categorized as posters with identical metrics.\n\n**Historical Context:** Prior years used different scales—CoRL 2023 and 2022 employed a 4.20-10.00 range, indicating a scoring methodology change for 2024.\n\n**Notable Detail:** Only 1 withdrawal occurred post-decision (0.15%), and no desk rejections were recorded for CoRL 2024, contrasting with the inclusion of these categories in earlier years."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e6dd661-5539-4780-b46e-9be6f0e5cc6e","uuid":"fa118bda-51ec-4b65-ba16-542077ca8c6f","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:27:00.860Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":222526,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# CoRL 2024 Review Statistics\n\n**Acceptance Rate:** 39.34% (264 accepted out of 671 total submissions)\n\n**Scoring Scale:** The page indicates a 1-4 point scale for CoRL 2024, differing from previous years.\n\n**Score Range for Accepted Papers:** \n- Minimum: 1.70\n- Maximum: 4.00\n- Average: 3.01 (std: 0.37)\n\n**Key Observation:** The data shows that \"all accepted papers received the same score distribution\" as the overall venue, suggesting all 264 accepted papers were categorized as posters with identical metrics.\n\n**Historical Context:** Prior years used different scales—CoRL 2023 and 2022 employed a 4.20-10.00 range, indicating a scoring methodology change for 2024.\n\n**Notable Detail:** Only 1 withdrawal occurred post-decision (0.15%), and no desk rejections were recorded for CoRL 2024, contrasting with the inclusion of these categories in earlier years.","durationMs":4580,"url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/"}}
