{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dq31fU54DrgtxYv3g64Hs4","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Project Memory — diff_collision_sdf\\\\n\\\\n## OpenVLA SafeLIBERO 兼容性（2026-05-25）\\\\n- OpenVLA action space = 7D delta EE pose，直接兼容 SafeLIBERO\\\\n- 需要 gripper 符号翻转：OpenVLA 0=close/1=open → LIBERO +1=close/-1=open\\\\n- 图像需 180° 旋转（OpenVLA LIBERO training convention）\\\\n- Base OpenVLA = single-step prediction（replan_steps=1，无 action chunking）\\\\n- VLSA 论文（arXiv:2512.11891）已有 OpenVLA-OFT 在 SafeLIBERO 的结果：object CAR=17.25% TSR=29.50%\\\\n\\\\n## OpenVLA eval 部署（2026-05-25, Reviewer 锁定 base-only）\\\\n- **范围**: object_pudding 单 task × 200 episodes（~5h），先验证 fake safety pattern\\\\n- **只跑 base model**：不跑 fine-tuned 变体，避免反向削弱 Claim 1\\\\n- **模型路径**: `/root/autodl-tmp/openvla-7b-raw/`（下载完成 ✓）\\\\n- **启动命令**: `cd /root/colliforce-vla && python scripts/eval_safelibero_openvla.py --model_path /root/autodl-tmp/openvla-7b-raw/ --scene object_pudding --task_id 0 --n_episodes 200 --gpu 0`\\\\n\\\\n## Pi0 baseline fake_rate 量化结果（2026-05-25, P0 已填）\\\\n- Pi0 Full-FT: fake_safe=82.5%, 非碰撞中冻结 99.4%, 中位 displacement ~5nm\\\\n- Pi0 LoRA: fake_safe=89.0%, 非碰撞中冻结 98.9%\\\\n- A1 LoRA: 91.1%, A3: 76.4% — 参考\\\\n- **结论**: fake safety 是 Pi0 固有行为，非 A1/SDF 引入\\\\n\\\\n## 论文叙事主次（2026-05-25, Reviewer 指导）\\\\n- **Pi0.5 为主证据**: TSR=73%, fake_rate=98.2%\\\\n- **Pi0 为辅助**: TSR=0% 是 trivial case\\\\n- OpenVLA 作为第三 family 证明泛化性\\\\n\\\\n## westd-35807 环境（2026-05-25）\\\\n- conda 环境名：`libero`（不是 base）\\\\n- 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB\\\\n- 训练代码路径：`/root/colliforce-vla/`\\\\n- **wandb 未配置**：训练命令需加 `export WANDB_MODE=disabled`\\\\n- **eval 命令必须加 `--suite safelibero_object`**\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ M040: Eval 正确参数（2026-05-25，3 次踩坑后确认）\\\\n- **config_name**: `pi05_libero`（不是 `baseline_object_pudding`）\\\\n- **model_type**: LoRA checkpoint 用 `lora_baseline`（不是 `a1`）——先注入 LoRA adapter 再加载 safetensors\\\\n- **GPU 绑定**: eval 脚本 L1127 `os.environ[\\\\\\\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\\\\"] = str(args.gpu)` 覆盖 shell 环境变量。必须用 `--gpu N` 指定物理卡号（如 `--gpu 2`），**不能**靠 `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=2 --gpu 0`\\\\n- **正确命令模板**：\\\\n  ```bash\\\\n  nohup bash -c 'source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base && cd /root/colliforce-vla && export WANDB_MODE=disabled && python scripts/eval_safelibero.py --checkpoint <CKPT_PATH> --config_name pi05_libero --suite safelibero_object --model_type lora_baseline --pi05 --seed 0 --gpu <PHYSICAL_GPU_ID>' > logs/eval_xxx.log 2>&1 &\\\\n  ```\\\\n\\\\n## westd-45947 环境（2026-05-25）\\\\n- conda 环境名：`base`\\\\n- 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB\\\\n\\\\n## Phase 2 LoRA 解冻速度降级 M034（2026-05-25）\\\\n- Phase 1 (frozen LoRA): ~1.3s/step\\\\n- Phase 2 (unfrozen LoRA): ~4.6s/step（3.5× 慢）\\\\n- 30K 步训练实际耗时 ~34h\\\\n\\\\n## M035: SAVE_TOTAL_LIMIT 教训（2026-05-25）\\\\n- SAVE_TOTAL_LIMIT=2 导致 10K checkpoint 被清理，λ_sdf=0 ablation 需额外 8h 重训\\\\n- **今后规则**: 有中间 checkpoint 分叉需求时，设 SAVE_TOTAL_LIMIT≥3\\\\n\\\\n## M036: Eval episode counting（2026-05-25）\\\\n- SafeLIBERO eval 总 episode 数 = n_tasks × n_episodes_per_task（如 4 tasks × 200 = 800 total）\\\\n- 读 eval 进度时 X/200 是单 task 内进度，不是总进度\\\\n\\\\n## M037: 术语修正 — fake_safe vs safe_but_fail（2026-05-25）\\\\n- 项目定义 fake_safe = displacement < 0.1mm = frozen（机器人未动）\\\\n- 当 frozen=0% 时不存在 fake_safe\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ M038: Eval checkpoint 路径核实教训（2026-05-25）\\\\n- 4 个 \\\\\\\"30K eval\\\\\\\" 实际加载了 `/best/` checkpoint 而非 `/30000/`\\\\n- **今后规则**: 启动 eval 后必须用 `ps aux | grep` 核实命令行中的 checkpoint 路径\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ M039: Worker 诊断效率纪律（2026-05-25）\\\\n- Worker 诊断/调试超过 5 轮未解决必须上报 Agent，由 Agent 决策是否 cancel 并换方案\\\\n- 不能让 Worker 空转 30 轮 ssh_read_only 而不执行修复\\\\n- **今后规则**: spawn Worker 时明确限制诊断轮次上限（如\\\\\\\"最多 5 轮 SSH，未解决立即汇报\\\\\\\"）\\\\n\\\\n## spatial_bowl 训练（2026-05-25, Director 锁定 l005）\\\\n- 命令需加 `export WANDB_MODE=disabled`\\\\n- 预估 ~34h，SAVE_TOTAL_LIMIT≥3\\\\n\\\\n## λ_sdf=0 Phase 2 ablation（2026-05-25, Director 批准, cuda:3）\\\\n- **Stage 1** (重训 10K, λ=0.005): 需加 `export WANDB_MODE=disabled`\\\\n- **Stage 2** (resume from 10K, λ=0): 同上\\\\n\\\\n## Cosine λ decay ablation（2026-05-25, Director 新增）\\\\n- 代码已实现（`--lambda_schedule cosine`）\\\\n- 排在 cuda:2 或 cuda:3 eval 完成后启动\\\\n\\\\n## Best checkpoint eval Task 0 结果（2026-05-25, ⚠️ 非 30K）\\\\n- s1_l005 (best=step16K): TSR=30.5%, CAR=56.5%, frozen=0%\\\\n- s1_l01 (best=step16K): TSR=26.5%, CAR=52.5%, frozen=0%\\\\n- s2_l005 (best=step10K): TSR=26.0%, CAR=57.5%, frozen=0%\\\\n- s2_l01 (best=step10K): TSR=22.5%, CAR=55.5%, frozen=0%\\\\n\\\\n## 当前 GPU 分配（2026-05-26 ~01:35 UTC）\\\\n- westd-35807 cuda:0 → spatial_bowl 训练 (PID 3708)\\\\n- westd-35807 cuda:1 → λ=0.1 high seed0 训练 (PID 271266)\\\\n- westd-35807 cuda:2 → λ=0.1 high seed1 训练 (PID 274407)\\\\n- westd-35807 cuda:3 → Phase 2 λ=0 ablation seed2 (PID 254634)\\\\n- westd-45947 cuda:0 → LoRA baseline eval s0（提交中）\\\\n- westd-45947 cuda:1 → LoRA baseline eval s1（提交中）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4316, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013nCxBRTTrC7C4kDzoJmBr2","session_id":"2e6dd661-5539-4780-b46e-9be6f0e5cc6e","uuid":"e114d8b5-28d9-4579-be85-f043f361050a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:28:13.334Z"}
