ce 稳定性'\n115\t  priority: P0\n116\t  gpu_budget_hours: 30\n117\t  deps: []\n118\t  registry_id: null\n119\t  status: planned\n120\t  notes: Dream 三档均指出 Phase 2 single seed 不可接受。待 Phase 2 seed2 完成确认方向后启动\n121\t- id: plan_013\n122\t  claim: 4\n123\t  description: 'LoRA baseline seed2: 第三个 LoRA-only 种子，使 SDF 归因对比有 3v3 seeds 的统计严格性'\n124\t  priority: P1\n125\t  gpu_budget_hours: 20\n126\t  deps:\n127\t  - plan_004\n128\t  registry_id: train_pi05_lora_baseline_s2\n129\t  status: planned\n130\t  notes: Dream worst-case 指出 2-seed LoRA vs 3-seed SDF 无法 claim 'statistically indistinguishable'\n131\t- id: plan_014\n132\t  claim: 1\n133\t  description: 'dfCAR threshold sensitivity analysis (CPU-only): 在 δ={2mm, 5mm, 10mm,\n134\t    20mm, 50mm, 100mm} 上计算 filtered CAR/FSR，展示 threshold robustness'\n135\t  priority: P0\n136\t  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n137\t  deps: []\n138\t  registry_id: null\n139\t  status: planned\n140\t  notes: Dream 三档均要求。CPU 分析，从已有 eval JSON 提取 EE displacement 分布即可\n141\t- id: plan_015\n142\t  claim: 4\n143\t  description: 'spatial_bowl LoRA-only control: 在 spatial_bowl 场景训练 LoRA-only (无 SDF)，完成跨场景归因'\n144\t  priority: P1\n145\t  gpu_budget_hours: 34\n146\t  deps:\n147\t  - plan_007\n148\t  registry_id: null\n149\t  status: planned\n150\t  notes: 'Dream worst-case: 无 LoRA control 则 spatial_bowl +9pp 无法归因 SDF'\n151\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013nCxBRTTrC7C4kDzoJmBr2","session_id":"2e6dd661-5539-4780-b46e-9be6f0e5cc6e","uuid":"1f01850b-c088-4759-acd7-6e6d0ba7903e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:28:38.678Z"}
