{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011TKTWdFv8xReqsabAm9ZfQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# ColliForce-VLA Literature Map\n2\t# Updated: 2026-05-25\n3\t\n4\tpapers:\n5\t\n6\t  # ===== 已有论文 =====\n7\t\n8\t  - paper_id: \"2512.11891\"\n9\t    title: \"VLSA: Vision-Language-Action Models with Plug-and-Play Safety Constraint Layer\"\n10\t    authors: \"Hu et al.\"\n11\t    year: 2025\n12\t    venue: arXiv\n13\t    role: direct-competitor\n14\t    category: collision-aware-vla\n15\t    one_line_summary: \"AEGIS/SafeLIBERO — 用 CBF 安全约束层实现 VLA 碰撞回避，是外挂式安全机制，不改变 VLA 内部空间表征；ColliForce 的核心对比对象。\"\n16\t\n17\t  - paper_id: \"2510.14836\"\n18\t    title: \"QDepth-VLA: Quantized Depth Prediction as Auxiliary Supervision for Vision-Language-Action Models\"\n19\t    authors: \"Li et al.\"\n20\t    year: 2025\n21\t    venue: arXiv\n22\t    role: direct-competitor\n23\t    category: spatial-aware-vla\n24\t    one_line_summary: \"用量化深度预测作为 VLA 辅助监督增强空间推理；与 ColliForce 的 SDF 辅助损失思路类似但用深度而非 SDF，且在 camera frame 而非 workspace frame。\"\n25\t\n26\t  - paper_id: \"2510.12276\"\n27\t    title: \"Spatial Forcing: Implicit Spatial Representation Alignment for Vision-language-action Model\"\n28\t    authors: \"Li et al.\"\n29\t    year: 2025\n30\t    venue: ICLR 2026\n31\t    role: method-component\n32\t    category: spatial-aware-vla\n33\t    one_line_summary: \"隐式对齐 VLA 中间层视觉嵌入与 3D 基础模型几何表征，证明隐式 3D 对齐对 VLA 有效；ColliForce 将对齐目标从通用 3D 几何特化为 SDF/occupancy field。\"\n34\t\n35\t  - paper_id: \"2307.05973\"\n36\t    title: \"VoxPoser: Composable 3D Value Maps for Robotic Manipulation with Language Models\"\n37\t    authors: \"Huang et al.\"\n38\t    year: 2023\n39\t    venue: CoRL 2023\n40\t    role: method-component\n41\t    category: sdf-robotics\n42\t    one_line_summary: \"用 LLM 生成 3D 体素 value maps（含 avoidance maps）引导机器人操作规划；启发了 ColliForce 用 3D 空间场引导动作生成的思路。\"\n43\t\n44\t  - paper_id: \"2410.24164\"\n45\t    title: \"pi0: A Vision-Language-Action Flow Model for General Robot Control\"\n46\t    authors: \"Black et al., Physical Intelligence\"\n47\t    year: 2024\n48\t    venue: arXiv\n49\t    role: backbone\n50\t    category: vla-foundation\n51\t    one_line_summary: \"基于 PaliGemma VLM + flow matching 的通用 VLA 基座模型；ColliForce 的基座架构，在其上添加 SDF 辅助监督分支。\"\n52\t\n53\t  - paper_id: \"1901.05103\"\n54\t    title: \"DeepSDF: Learning Continuous Signed Distance Functions for Shape Representation\"\n55\t    authors: \"Park et al.\"\n56\t    year: 2019\n57\t    venue: CVPR 2019\n58\t    role: method-component\n59\t    category: sdf-representation\n60\t    one_line_summary: \"开创性地用深度网络学习连续 SDF 表示；ColliForce 中 workspace SDF 的表征方法论基础。\"\n61\t\n62\t  - paper_id: \"2307.00533\"\n63\t    title: \"Representing Robot Geometry as Distance Fields: Applications to Whole-body Manipulation\"\n64\t    authors: \"Liu et al.\"\n65\t    year: 2023\n66\t    venue: arXiv\n67\t    role: method-component\n68\t    category: sdf-robotics\n69\t    one_line_summary: \"用 Bernstein 多项式编码机器人连杆 SDF 并集成到优化问题中实现可微碰撞检测；验证了 SDF 在机器人碰撞检测中的可行性。\"\n70\t\n71\t  # ===== 新增 P0: 直接竞品 — 碰撞感知操纵 / Safe Manipulation =====\n72\t\n73\t  - paper_id: \"2503.03480\"\n74\t    title: \"SafeVLA: Towards Safety Alignment of Vision-Language-Action Model via Constrained Learning\"\n75\t    authors: \"Zhang et al.\"\n76\t    year: 2025\n77\t    venue: NeurIPS 2025 (Spotlight)\n78\t    arxiv: \"2503.03480\"\n79\t    role: direct-competitor\n80\t    category: collision-aware-vla\n81\t    summary: \"用 CMDP 范式对 VLA 策略施加安全约束，通过 safe RL 优化减少 83.58% 安全违规成本。\"\n82\t    relevance: \"最直接竞品之一：同样关注 VLA 安全性，但走 constrained RL 路线（外部约束优化），ColliForce 走内部空间表征增强路线（SDF 辅助监督），方法论互补。\"\n83\t\n84\t  - paper_id: \"2407.00451\"\n85\t    title: \"Language-Guided Object-Centric Diffusion Policy for Collision-Aware Robotic Manipulation\"\n86\t    authors: \"Li et al.\"\n87\t    year: 2024\n88\t    venue: ICRA 2025\n89\t    arxiv: \"2407.00451\"\n90\t    role: direct-competitor\n91\t    category: collision-aware-vla\n92\t    summary: \"在 3D 点云上训练 diffusion policy 预测末端轨迹，推理时通过 cost-guided denoising 实现 training-free 碰撞回避。\"\n93\t    relevance: \"碰撞回避在推理阶段通过 cost optimization 注入；ColliForce 在训练阶段通过 SDF 辅助损失嵌入碰撞感知，设计哲学不同。\"\n94\t\n95\t  - paper_id: \"2511.22773\"\n96\t    title: \"CAPE: Context-Aware Diffusion Policy Via Proximal Mode Expansion for Collision Avoidance\"\n97\t    authors: \"Yang et al.\"\n98\t    year: 2025\n99\t    venue: arXiv\n100\t    arxiv: \"2511.22773\"\n101\t    role: direct-competitor\n102\t    category: collision-aware-vla\n103\t    summary: \"通过 context-aware prior 和 prior-seeded iterative guided refinement 扩展轨迹分布模态，cluttered 场景碰撞回避提升 26-80%。\"\n104\t    relevance: \"推理阶段碰撞回避方法，与 ColliForce 训练阶段 SDF 注入形成对比；可讨论 train-time vs. test-time 安全注入的 trade-off。\"\n105\t\n106\t  - paper_id: \"2409.08233\"\n107\t    title: \"Towards Online Safety Corrections for Robotic Manipulation Policies\"\n108\t    authors: \"Spalter et al.\"\n109\t    year: 2024\n110\t    venue: arXiv\n111\t    arxiv: \"2409.08233\"\n112\t    role: direct-competitor\n113\t    category: collision-aware-vla\n114\t    summary: \"iKinQP-RL：用逆运动学 QP 控制器在运行时修正 RL 策略动作，完全消除与未见障碍物的碰撞。\"\n115\t    relevance: \"运行时安全修正层，类似 VLSA 的外挂思路；ColliForce 不需额外安全层，通过 SDF 辅助监督让策略自身学会碰撞感知。\"\n116\t\n117\t  # ===== 新增 P0b: 碰撞感知操纵补充 (2024-2026) =====\n118\t\n119\t  - paper_id: \"2601.21712\"\n120\t    title: \"CoFreeVLA: Collision-Free Dual-Arm Manipulation via Vision-Language-Action Model and Risk Estimation\"\n121\t    authors: \"Zhai et al.\"\n122\t    year: 2026\n123\t    venue: arXiv\n124\t    arxiv: \"2601.21712\"\n125\t    role: direct-competitor\n126\t    category: collision-aware-vla\n127\t    summary: \"在 VLA 策略上外挂短时域自碰撞风险估计器，预测碰撞概率并门控危险动作，通过 risk-guided 调整恢复安全状态。在 PiPER 双臂平台 5 个任务上减少自碰撞并提升成功率。\"\n128\t    relevance: \"VLA + 碰撞安全的最新工作；采用外部风险估计器（post-hoc 过滤）路线，与 ColliForce 训练时 SDF 嵌入的内在路线形成对比。可讨论 internal representation vs. external filter 的 trade-off。\"\n129\t\n130\t  - paper_id: \"2404.02284\"\n131\t    title: \"APEX: Ambidextrous Dual-Arm Robotic Manipulation Using Collision-Free Generative Diffusion Models\"\n132\t    authors: \"Dastider et al.\"\n133\t    year: 2024\n134\t    venue: IROS 2024\n135\t    arxiv: \"2404.02284\"\n136\t    role: related-approach\n137\t    category: collision-aware-manipulation\n138\t    summary: \"用潜在扩散模型生成双臂操作轨迹，通过 classifier-guidance 技术集成障碍物信息保证轨迹无碰撞。在双臂硬件平台上超越传统运动规划算法。\"\n139\t    relevance: \"Test-time classifier-guidance 碰撞回避，与 Lan-o3dp/CAPE 同属推理阶段安全注入方法族；ColliForce 在训练阶段通过 SDF 辅助损失嵌入，不需推理时额外计算。\"\n140\t\n141\t  - paper_id: \"2512.11908\"\n142\t    title: \"Safe Learning for Contact-Rich Robot Tasks: A Survey from Classical Learning-Based Methods to Safe Foundation Models\"\n143\t    authors: \"Zhang et al.\"\n144\t    year: 2025\n145\t    venue: arXiv\n146\t    arxiv: \"2512.11908\"\n147\t    role: survey\n148\t    category: collision-aware-manipulation\n149\t    summary: \"系统综述安全接触任务的学习方法，覆盖 constrained RL、risk-sensitive optimization、CBF、MPC safety shields，并延伸到 foundation model 时代的安全挑战。\"\n150\t    relevance: \"Related Work 定位参考：ColliForce 属于该综述分类中 'training-time geometric supervision' 类别，与 constrained RL (SafeVLA) 和 runtime shields (VLSA/iKinQP) 构成三条路线。\"\n151\t\n152\t  # ===== 新增 P1: SDF/距离场在机器人学中的应用 =====\n153\t\n154\t  - paper_id: \"2204.02296\"\n155\t    title: \"iSDF: Real-Time Neural Signed Distance Fields for Robot Perception\"\n156\t    authors: \"Ortiz et al.\"\n157\t    year: 2022\n158\t    venue: RSS 2022\n159\t    arxiv: \"2204.02296\"\n160\t    role: method-component\n161\t    category: sdf-robotics\n162\t    summary: \"从流式深度图像持续学习神经 SDF，将 3D 坐标映射为有符号距离值，实现实时机器人场景感知。\"\n163\t    relevance: \"验证了神经 SDF 可实时构建用于机器人感知；ColliForce 的 workspace SDF ground truth 生成和在线推理可参考其方法。\"\n164\t\n165\t  - paper_id: \"2305.10534\"\n166\t    title: \"RAMP: Hierarchical Reactive Motion Planning for Manipulation Tasks Using Implicit Signed Distance Functions\"\n167\t    authors: \"Vasilopoulos et al.\"\n168\t    year: 2023\n169\t    venue: IROS 2023\n170\t    arxiv: \"2305.10534\"\n171\t    role: method-component\n172\t    category: sdf-robotics\n173\t    summary: \"结合 MPPI 控制器和局部向量场控制器，用 SDF 做碰撞检测和反应式避障的层次化运动规划。\"\n174\t    relevance: \"展示 SDF 在 reactive manipulation planning 中的有效性；ColliForce 将 SDF 从规划模块提升到学习模块，让策略网络直接编码距离场信息。\"\n175\t\n176\t  - paper_id: \"2102.07413\"\n177\t    title: \"DiffCo: Auto-Differentiable Proxy Collision Detection with Multi-class Labels for Safety-Aware Trajectory Optimization\"\n178\t    authors: \"Zhi et al.\"\n179\t    year: 2021\n180\t    venue: IEEE T-RO\n181\t    arxiv: \"2102.07413\"\n182\t    role: method-component\n183\t    category: sdf-robotics\n184\t    summary: \"全自动可微的非参数碰撞检测模型，在线计算碰撞边界并通过反向传播提供鲁棒梯度用于轨迹优化。\"\n185\t    relevance: \"可微碰撞检测关键工作，证明碰撞信息可通过梯度传播融入优化；ColliForce 的 SDF 辅助损失本质也是让碰撞信息参与梯度反传。\"\n186\t\n187\t  # ===== 新增 P1b: SDF/距离场在机器人学补充 (2024-2025) =====\n188\t\n189\t  - paper_id: \"2406.01137\"\n190\t    title: \"Configuration Space Distance Fields for Manipulation Planning\"\n191\t    authors: \"Li, Chi, Razmjoo, Calinon\"\n192\t    year: 2024\n193\t    venue: RSS 2024\n194\t    arxiv: \"2406.01137\"\n195\t    role: method-component\n196\t    category: sdf-robotics\n197\t    summary: \"将 SDF 从任务空间扩展到机器人构型空间（C-space），直接估计到达接触/碰撞所需的最小关节运动量，并用于操作规划优化。\"\n198\t    relevance: \"直接回应 ColliForce 的 EE-only SDF 局限：CDF 在 C-space 工作天然覆盖全身碰撞，Related Work 中可作为 full-body SDF 方案的代表，讨论 task-space SDF vs. C-space SDF 的优劣。\"\n199\t\n200\t  - paper_id: \"2409.14955\"\n201\t    title: \"Efficient Collision Detection Framework for Enhancing Collision-Free Robot Motion\"\n202\t    authors: \"Zhu et al.\"\n203\t    year: 2024\n204\t    venue: arXiv\n205\t    arxiv: \"2409.14955\"\n206\t    role: method-component\n207\t    category: sdf-robotics\n208\t    summary: \"通过正运动学分解机器人全身 SDF，用多个轻量并行网络近似各连杆 SDF，集成 SVM 自碰撞检测模块（SDF-SC），保持可微性用于轨迹优化。\"\n209\t    relevance: \"全身 SDF 分解方案，与 Liu et al. (2023) Bernstein 多项式方法互补；ColliForce 目前仅用 EE SDF，该工作展示了扩展到全身 SDF 的工程可行性。\"\n210\t\n211\t  - paper_id: \"2511.21312\"\n212\t    title: \"Neural NMPC through Signed Distance Field Encoding for Collision Avoidance\"\n213\t    authors: \"Jacquet, Harms, Alexis\"\n214\t    year: 2025\n215\t    venue: IJRR 2025\n216\t    arxiv: \"2511.21312\"\n217\t    role: method-component\n218\t    category: sdf-robotics\n219\t    summary: \"用卷积编码器将深度图像压缩为潜向量，MLP 近似对应空间 SDF，作为 NMPC 的显式位置约束实现无地图碰撞回避。森林环境真机验证。\"\n220\t    relevance: \"展示 SDF 作为控制约束的端到端集成路径（感知→SDF→控制）；ColliForce 将 SDF 集成到学习策略（感知→SDF→policy loss），两者互为对照。\"\n221\t\n222\t  # ===== 新增 P2: VLA 基座模型系列 =====\n223\t\n224\t  - paper_id: \"2307.15818\"\n225\t    title: \"RT-2: Vision-Language-Action Models Transfer Web Knowledge to Robotic Control\"\n226\t    authors: \"Brohan et al., Google DeepMind\"\n227\t    year: 2023\n228\t    venue: arXiv\n229\t    arxiv: \"2307.15818\"\n230\t    role: foundational\n231\t    category: vla-foundation\n232\t    summary: \"将动作表示为文本 token，在视觉-语言任务和机器人轨迹数据上联合微调 VLM，实现网络知识到机器人控制的迁移。\"\n233\t    relevance: \"VLA 范式奠基工作，确立 VLM→VLA 微调范式；ColliForce 在此范式基础上增加 SDF 辅助分支。\"\n234\t\n235\t  - paper_id: \"2406.09246\"\n236\t    title: \"OpenVLA: An Open-Source Vision-Language-Action Model\"\n237\t    authors: \"Kim et al.\"\n238\t    year: 2024\n239\t    venue: arXiv\n240\t    arxiv: \"2406.09246\"\n241\t    role: benchmark-source\n242\t    category: vla-foundation\n243\t    summary: \"7B 参数开源 VLA，基于 Llama 2 + DINOv2/SigLIP，970k 真实演示训练，29 任务上超越 RT-2-X 16.5%。\"\n244\t    relevance: \"主要 VLA baseline；ColliForce 可在其上验证 SDF 辅助监督的通用性。\"\n245\t\n246\t  - paper_id: \"2405.12213\"\n247\t    title: \"Octo: An Open-Source Generalist Robot Policy\"\n248\t    authors: \"Octo Model Team\"\n249\t    year: 2024\n250\t    venue: arXiv\n251\t    arxiv: \"2405.12213\"\n252\t    role: benchmark-source\n253\t    category: vla-foundation\n254\t    summary: \"基于 Transformer 的通用策略，Open X-Embodiment 800k 轨迹训练，支持多传感器多动作空间，消费级 GPU 可快速微调。\"\n255\t    relevance: \"轻量级 VLA baseline；ColliForce 的 SDF 辅助分支可测试在小模型上的效果。\"\n256\t\n257\t  # ===== 新增 P3: Benchmark =====\n258\t\n259\t  - title: \"LIBERO: Benchmarking Knowledge Transfer for Lifelong Robot Learning\"\n260\t    authors: \"Bo Liu, Yifeng Zhu, Chongkai Gao, Yihao Feng, Qiang Liu, Yuke Zhu, Peter Stone\"\n261\t    venue: \"NeurIPS 2023\"\n262\t    arxiv: \"2306.03310\"\n263\t    role: benchmark\n264\t    relevance: \"SafeLIBERO benchmark 的基础；定义了 Spatial/Goal/Object/Long 四个 suite 的任务结构和评估协议\"\n265\t\n266\t  # ===== 新增 P4: 生成式建模基础方法 =====\n267\t\n268\t  - title: \"Flow Matching for Generative Modeling\"\n269\t    authors: \"Yaron Lipman, Ricky T. Q. Chen, Heli Ben-Hamu, Maximilian Nickel, Matt Le\"\n270\t    venue: \"ICLR 2023\"\n271\t    arxiv: \"2210.02747\"\n272\t    role: method-component\n273\t    relevance: \"π0 base model 使用的 flow matching 训练范式；ColliForce gradient-guided refinement 基于 flow matching 的 ODE solver 进行梯度注入\"\n274\t\n275\t  # ===== 新增 P5: Action Collapse / Mode Collapse =====\n276\t\n277\t  - paper_id: \"2505.11123\"\n278\t    title: \"Conditioning Matters: Training Diffusion Policies is Faster Than You Think\"\n279\t    authors: \"Dong et al.\"\n280\t    year: 2025\n281\t    venue: arXiv\n282\t    arxiv: \"2505.11123\"\n283\t    role: related-approach\n284\t    category: action-collapse\n285\t    summary: \"发现 diffusion policy 训练中的 'loss collapse'——observation 条件难区分时训练退化为建模 marginal action 分布而非 condition-specific 分布，提出 Cocos 通过条件依赖的源分布锚定解决。\"\n286\t    relevance: \"与 ColliForce 的 action collapse 机制类似：collision penalty 可导致策略忽略 task-relevant conditioning 而坍缩到 degenerate marginal（如静止不动），提供了 diffusion policy 中 loss collapse 的理论对照。\"\n287\t\n288\t  - paper_id: \"2303.04137\"\n289\t    title: \"Diffusion Policy: Visuomotor Policy Learning via Action Diffusion\"\n290\t    authors: \"Chi et al.\"\n291\t    year: 2023\n292\t    venue: RSS 2023 / IJRR 2024\n293\t    arxiv: \"2303.04137\"\n294\t    role: foundational\n295\t    category: action-collapse\n296\t    summary: \"提出基于扩散模型的视觉运动策略，解决行为克隆中的 mode averaging 问题——标准回归策略在多模态演示上取均值产生不安全的中间轨迹。\"\n297\t    relevance: \"定义了 IL 中 mode averaging/collapse 的规范表述；ColliForce 的 collision penalty 可能在表达性策略架构中重新引入类似的模态坍缩，将动作分布推向单一 'freeze' 模态。\"\n298\t\n299\t  # ===== 新增 P6: Safe RL / Safe Imitation Learning =====\n300\t\n301\t  - paper_id: \"1705.10528\"\n302\t    title: \"Constrained Policy Optimization\"\n303\t    authors: \"Achiam et al.\"\n304\t    year: 2017\n305\t    venue: ICML 2017\n306\t    arxiv: \"1705.10528\"\n307\t    role: foundational\n308\t    category: safe-rl\n309\t    summary: \"训练时安全 RL 基础方法，在 trust-region 框架中约束策略更新满足 cost 限制，形式化为 constrained MDP。\"\n310\t    relevance: \"Safe RL 奠基工作；仅用标量 cost 信号，不含几何碰撞信息，不处理高维视觉-语言观测空间。ColliForce 的可微 SDF 辅助损失提供比 CPO 标量约束更丰富的连续几何安全信号。\"\n311\t\n312\t  - paper_id: \"2409.19190\"\n313\t    title: \"RAIL: Reachability-Aided Imitation Learning for Safe Policy Execution\"\n314\t    authors: \"Jung et al.\"\n315\t    year: 2025\n316\t    venue: ICRA 2025\n317\t    arxiv: \"2409.19190\"\n318\t    role: related-approach\n319\t    category: safe-rl\n320\t    summary: \"测试时安全方法：训练标准 IL 策略后用可达性分析安全过滤器在运行时覆盖不安全动作，实现 0% 碰撞率。\"\n321\t    relevance: \"策略本身不学安全，与 ColliForce 训练时 SDF 嵌入形成对比。解耦方式意味着过滤器频繁干预时可能降低任务性能，ColliForce 通过让策略原生碰撞感知来避免这一问题。\"\n322\t\n323\t  - paper_id: \"2503.17432\"\n324\t    title: \"TamedPUMA: Safe and Stable Imitation Learning with Geometric Fabrics\"\n325\t    authors: \"Bakker et al.\"\n326\t    year: 2025\n327\t    venue: L4DC 2025\n328\t    arxiv: \"2503.17432\"\n329\t    role: related-approach\n330\t    category: safe-rl\n331\t    summary: \"将学习的运动基元与 geometric fabrics 融合，在运行时强制碰撞回避和关节限制，需已知障碍物解析表示。\"\n332\t    relevance: \"运行时安全机制叠加在 IL 之上；需要运行时解析障碍物表示，ColliForce 在训练时嵌入 SDF 使策略泛化到新场景而无需运行时几何计算。\"\n333\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013nCxBRTTrC7C4kDzoJmBr2","session_id":"2e6dd661-5539-4780-b46e-9be6f0e5cc6e","uuid":"3463a7ea-468b-43f6-a6ca-ddf03d8df729","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:28:54.488Z"}
