{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01EQiLXv7VVAhYdMptQTwpBA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review report submitted. \n\n**Summary:** Both reviewers independently converged on **2/4 (Reject)** with **Significance 3/4**. The fake safety finding and dfCAR metric are genuine contributions, but the paper has critical gaps: narrow experimental scope (one benchmark, one model family), inadequate statistical power for the central null claim (needs TOST equivalence testing, not just failure to reject), severely underdeveloped related work (5 references), missing spatial_bowl LoRA-only control, and incomplete draft. A revised version addressing cross-architecture validation, equivalence testing, expanded related work, and complete experiments could be competitive at a future venue."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4746,"cache_read_input_tokens":84839,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4746},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e6dd661-5539-4780-b46e-9be6f0e5cc6e","uuid":"6681bb7e-4cfe-495c-b81e-5742e8d90e96"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":467083,"duration_api_ms":629080,"num_turns":21,"result":"Review report submitted. \n\n**Summary:** Both reviewers independently converged on **2/4 (Reject)** with **Significance 3/4**. The fake safety finding and dfCAR metric are genuine contributions, but the paper has critical gaps: narrow experimental scope (one benchmark, one model family), inadequate statistical power for the central null claim (needs TOST equivalence testing, not just failure to reject), severely underdeveloped related work (5 references), missing spatial_bowl LoRA-only control, and incomplete draft. A revised version addressing cross-architecture validation, equivalence testing, expanded related work, and complete experiments could be competitive at a future venue.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2e6dd661-5539-4780-b46e-9be6f0e5cc6e","total_cost_usd":3.24001725,"usage":{"input_tokens":544,"cache_creation_input_tokens":78138,"cache_read_input_tokens":809572,"output_tokens":11852,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":78138,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":149,"cache_read_input_tokens":84839,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4746,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4746},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":202543,"outputTokens":4180,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":15,"costUSD":0.373443,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":574,"outputTokens":23011,"cacheReadInputTokens":1716671,"cacheCreationInputTokens":228815,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.8665742499999993,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"compl